<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Etɛp e syela Sisim natel Zaŋ ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana mɛ Etɛp e syela Sisim natel Zaŋ ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Etɛp e syela Sisim natel Zaŋ ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Etp</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana mɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Etɛp e syela Sisim natel Zaŋ ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ etɛp e syela Yezu nalwom fofop ngɔt náá, nyɛ tel Zaŋ ɛ, étɛp nyɛ eelyaal bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ esa ee di náá, yɛ eezekunaa nɛ ɛzyɛ ɛ. Nyɛ eeke: «Mam ɛ́ di mot di nɛ tsik ɔ, mɛ naagwyɛ, tin, nenak, mɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. Deenek, mam ɛ di nɛ ghwyil kɔ ɛsyee. Mam ɛ di nɛ ghwyil kɔ dɛl ɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ» <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:18">1.18</ref></char>. Nyɛ naalwom Zaŋ náá, nyɛ kwyal bɛmɛkana etɛn nɛ ebá, da kyeed pɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ ebá di pɛ kyee dik Azi ɛ. Bot ɛ di sama nɛ nɛ ɔ, bɛ waaboma nɛ mezuk kwaasa náá, bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ, aagóaa. «Mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ waadjɛ nyɛ bum le di edjɛ tsik di tɔ bok ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 1:9-3:22">1.9–3.22</ref></char>). Yezu nyɛ ɛmet ɛ Mɔɔ bhata ɛ Zɛɛb nakaaa buwa di goka nɛ ɛnɔɔ mɛkana, da dii yɛ. Efofop nɛ esesɛɛ djas goka ɛ́ ɛdjɛ Zɛɛb nɛ Yezu duu nɛ duma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 4-5">4–5</ref></char>). Ye nakoozodi eboo mezuk nɛ mɛtiigaa aasael kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, Zɛɛb eekwom efute étɛp bot ɛ nawa ɛbwaalel nɛ nɛ ɔ, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nagóaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 6-11">6–11</ref></char>). É di'enek, Satan, nɛ efofop bɛ, nɛ bot nadi ààlooba ɔ, bɛ waamwasaa tɔ boo tok du mɛsii na goo-goo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12-19">12–19</ref></char>). Deenek, gwoo nɛ bɔs di mos'aak aanàbaadi, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ gwoo na bes, nɛ bɔs na bes zɛnɔɔ ghaada na bes. Tin, Zɛɛb bɛ nɛ Yezu zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ nalooba nɛ nɛ ɔ, bɛ aasulal ɛ́ tin kɔm-kɔm sii mɛ kɔm (<char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 20-22">20–22</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Etɛp e syela Yezu Klisto natel Zaŋ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Mɛkana mak ɛ́ nɛ etɛp nadi tɔ sɔ yii Yezu Klisto nawyisal yɛ popoopwon ɛ. Zɛɛb natel nyɛ etɛp tak ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neelyaal bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ sa di náá, yɛ eezekɔ nɛ ɛsael ɛ. Deenek, Klisto naakyeed fofop'ɛ pɛ daa Zaŋ mot-mɛsa mɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neetel nyɛ etɛp binek. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Mam tyaasɛs Zaŋ, mɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, etɛp djas mɛ nabee ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee Yezu Klisto natel mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Mɛmyaala nɛ mot di elaa mɛkana mak ɔ, mɛmyaala nɛ mot di egwak mɛkpa mɛ di edus pɛ daa Zɛɛb, da nyɛ ɛ́ di elooba ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ etɛp di kwyala wak ɛ! Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala di náá, etɛp binek djas aasael ɛ́ yɛ eezekunaa.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel nɛ bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Zaŋ, mɛ eeswos bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ ebá di pɛ kyee dik Azi ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Beta náá, Zɛɛb mot di ɔ, mot nadi ɔ, mot di ezyɛ ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ esisim etɛn nɛ ebá dyeebadi sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Beta náá, Yezu Klisto, mot di tyaasɛs tɔ esosoob ɔ, mot di mot mɛkɛn nagomelaa pak myoŋ ɔ, mot di mɛkoozi bɛmɛkoozi mɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak ɔ, djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Klisto nɛ kwyɛl mena, nyɛ naapɛk mena tɔ mesyem dum nɛ buwa nyel'ɛ met nyɛ naka ɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Nyɛ eesa náá, mena dika ɛyoŋ ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. Beta náá, duu nɛ mɛbwala di nɛ nɛ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Beeka, nyɛ ɛpezyɛ tɔ eguud! Bot djas ɛ́ waabee nyɛ nɛ mis mɔɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nalum nyɛ nɛ ɛkɔɔ ɔ. Membyak djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ waadje mɛgwyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá: «Mɛ ɛ́ <char style="sc">Alfa</char> nɛ <char style="sc">Omegha</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔ lii eGhɛlɛk, Alfa kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ mɛkɛn, Omegha kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ mɛsik.</char></note>», mot di ɔ, mot nadi ɔ, mot di ezyɛ ɔ, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zaŋ eebee Klisto tɔ duma yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Zaŋ, mɔn-nyɛɛg'en, mot di egyee nɛ nen tɔ mezuk, tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ tɔ zii sama nɛ Yezu ɔ. Mɛ naakyeedaa nɛ bhel pɛ kyee dik ghola Patmɔs, kɔ ɛsu ɛ esosoob bam tɔ ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee Yezu natel mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Tin, é ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ, Sisim na Dɛɛ naazɛmɛt mɛ. Mɛ naazɛgwak dhiiti gwood elɔɔ bhii koŋ'am ɛlyelɛpe tyee boo tɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Gwood tak nake nɛ nam ɛ́ náá: «Etɛp ee wɔ di ebee ɛ, kwyala yɛ tɔ mɛkana, da wɔ ɛ́ kyeed yɛ pɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ ebá bak: zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Efɛɛz nɛ yii Simiin, nɛ yii Pɛɛlgham nɛ yii Tyatiid nɛ yii Saaldɛs nɛ yii Filadhɛlfi zɛnɔɔ yii Laodhise.» <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Tin, mɛ naazɛliigel étɛp ɛgwyák mot nadi elii nɛ nam ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛbee elama etɛn nɛ ebá nasaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">elama etɛn nɛ ebá nasaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pɛ daa eYuda, tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa bɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti kɔkɔ mbi lama nadi dáa mɔɔ le nɛ elɛɛ etɛn nɛ ebá.</char></note>. <figure style="fig" alt="Les 7 grandes lampes" file="WA04002b.tif" size="col" loc="1.12" copy="Graham Wade" ref="1.12,20">Elama etɛn nɛ ebá</figure><verse eid="REV 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Kuku elama etɛn nɛ ebá binek, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti djema di enɔŋel nɛ mɔn mot ɛ<note caller="*" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">mɔn mot </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dhan 7.13</ref></char></note>. Nyɛ nabɔt ɛ́ dhiiti ndjookuwa na ghɔlɔlɔɔ, nɛ bhɛtɛ nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Bhoo lo'ɛ nadi ɛ́ mɛpum dhaa tyɛ dáa ɛpyaab, mis mɛ nadi ekas dáa gel du, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />mɛko mɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa dáa gwooz di djóoaa blɔɔz ɛ tɔ boo du. Gwood'ɛ nadi egek ɛ́ dáa bhuuge boo dii mɛsɔn. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Tɔ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ, nyɛ namɛt ɛ́ ekwyikwyen etɛn nɛ ebá. Nuub'ɛ nadi ewyisal pɛl na wol-wol. Bhwoob'ɛ nadi ekas ɛlyelɛpe dáa mɛkas mɛ gwyes di enyan é kuku dwoo ɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />É ghɛŋ mɛ nabee nyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛghaaga si mɛko mɛ, ɛkɛɛ mot di náá, nyɛ eezegwyɛ ɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛkɛl mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ kɔ lam. É di'enek, nyɛy nɛ nam náá: «Nàbem ba, mam ɛ́ di Mɛkɛn nɛ Mɛsik. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Mam ɛ di mot di nɛ tsik ɔ, mɛ naagwyɛ, tin, nenak, mɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm. Deenek, mam ɛ́ di nɛ ghwyil kɔ ɛsyee. Mam ɛ di nɛ ghwyil kɔ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Kwyala sa wɔ bee ɛ: sa di nenak ɛ, nɛ sa aazyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Gwaka ɛsuk ɛ mɛbwala mɛ ekwyikwyen etɛn nɛ ebá wɔ bee tɔ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam ɛ, nɛ ɛsuk ɛ mɛbwala mɛ eboo elama etɛn nɛ ebá nasaa nɛ lɔɔd di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. Ekwyikwyen etɛn nɛ ebá kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́, efofop e ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ bɛbá. Tin, elama etɛn nɛ ebá binek kalyaal ɛ́, ezɛɛga mendjaala etɛn nɛ ebá.»<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Efɛɛz mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">Mot di nɛ ekwyikwyen etɛn nɛ ebá tɔ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ ɔ, mot di ekɛ kuku lama na mengel etɛn nɛ ebá nalulaa nɛ lɔɔd ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Mɛ nɛ gu mɛsa mɔ, mɛ nɛ gu mezuk mɔ, mɛ nɛ gu zii wɔ di nɛ yɛ ɛ. Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ààmaad bot ɛ di esa ɛbiyo ɔ. Wɔ naasaa ɛgu ɛ bot ɛ di ekɔɔ bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ lwoma ɔ, batakɛgu náá, bɛ tok bot ɛ lwoma, bɛ kɔɔ bot ɛ́ kɔɔak. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ zii, wɔ naazuk étɛp'am, é di'enek, wɔ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛghaaz. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Tin, mɛ ɛpelɛka nɛ nɔ: wɔ ààkakwyɛl mɛ dáa wɔ nadi ekwyɛl mɛ é mɛkɛn ɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Taala wɔy wɔ ɛmet di wɔ nadi ɛ, ɛsok nɛ náá, wɔ wo ze! Swoola mɛfulu mɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ sa mɛsa mɛ wɔ nasesa sok é mɛkɛn ɛ. Tin, wɔ byen ɛswoola ɔɔ, mɛ aazyɛ pɛ daa lɔ, da mɛ ɛ́ dis lama yɔ é di ye di ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Tin, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ sa wat mɛ di emyaala nɛ nɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ: Yɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ nɛ bhina mɛsa mɛ zɛɛga bot ɛ di edjóoaa eNikolayit ɔ, yii mam ɛmet di ebhina pe ɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Beta náá, mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">Tin, nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ aadjɛ nyɛ bɛ bum le tsik di tɔ paladi Zɛɛb ɛ.»<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Simiin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Simiin mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Mot di mɛkɛn nɛ mɛsik ɔ, mot nagwyɛ da gom ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mɛ nɛ gu mezuk mɔ nɛ edjel bɔ. Gua náá, wɔ ɛ́ mot ekum. Mɛ nɛ gu mɛbhekel mɛ bot ɛ di eke náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, di ebyak wɔ ɔ. Bela náá, bɛ tok bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ Satan. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Nabem kɛŋ nɛ mezuk mɛ wɔ aaboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. Gwaka: Dim mot mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waawa bin tɔ mɛbhowal, nyɛ waawa bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'en tɔ membok, bi ɛ́ waatiigaa é di mɛlu kam. Tin, dia sosoob kɛkum dwoo ɛsyee ɛ lɔ, é di'enek, mɛ aadjɛ wɔ kɔtɔ duu tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Beta náá, mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">Nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaakabaagwyɛ ngwyɛa sis.»<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Pɛɛlgham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Pɛɛlgham mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Mot di nɛ pɛl na wol-wol é mbɔ ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Mɛ nɛ gu di wɔ di ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ di Satan di ndiidel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ ɔ. Wɔ ɛ́ sosoob nɛ nam, wɔ ààpakat ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ nam, ye nakoozobɛ é ghɛŋ Antipas, mot nadi tyaasɛs'am tɔ esosoob nagóaa pɛ daa len, é di Satan di ɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ edhiiti ba bɔɔ esonok di náá, mɛ di elɛka nɛ nɔ étɛp tak ɛ. Tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala mɔ, wɔy ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di náá, bɛ ɛpedu mɛlyo mɛ Bhalaam ɔ. Bhalaam ɛ́ mot nadi ebesal mɛkoozi Bhalak náá, nyɛ laab bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl étɛp bɛ needɛ bɛtit ɛ nakaaa bɛnaghisɛ ebuwa ɔ, nɛ ɛdjaaz bɛ é mɛzɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ pe ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di náá, bɛ ɛpedu mɛlyo mɛ eNikolayit pɛ daa lɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Swoola mɛfulu mɔ. Yɛ di ààbɛ deenek ɔɔ, mɛ aanàbɔya nɛ ɛzyɛ pɛ daa lɔ, da mɛ ɛ́ lumla nɛ bot binɔk nɛ pɛl di ewyis tɔ nuub'am ɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Beta náá, mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">Nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ aadjɛ nyɛ edee syela di edjóoaa “man” ɛ. Mɛ waadjɛ mot nɛ mot ɛkok ɛ na puu. Pɛ kɔ ɛkok ɛ tak ɛ́ nɛ kwyala din na bes bot di ààgu ye di ààbɛ mot di ebela yɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Tyatiid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Tyatiid mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, mot mis mɛ di egel dáa boo ngel du ɔ, mot mɛko mɛ di tɔɔbelaa dáa gwooz di djóoaa blɔɔz tɔ boo du ɛ, lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mɛ nɛ gu mɛsa mɔ, nɛ kwyɛl'ɔ, nɛ esosoob bɔ, mɛ nɛ gu dáa wɔ di ewa lyem tɔ ɛsa mɛsa ɛ, mɛ nɛ gu zii wɔ di nɛ yɛ ɛ. Deenek, mɛ eezegu náá, mɛsa mɛ wɔ kadi esa mos'aak, yɛ eedhaa yii mɛkɛn. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Tin, mɛ ɛpelɛka nɛ nɔ: wɔ ɛpedjɛs Zezabɛl, moma di ekɔɔ bot náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Mɛlyo mɛ ɛpesa náá, bot ɛ mɛsa mam wo ze, yɛ ɛ́ ɛpedjɛs bɛ tɔ mɛzɔ nɛ ɛdɛ bɛtit ɛ nakaaa bɛnaghisɛ ebuwa ɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Mɛ eebet nyɛ ba mɔɔ pes ɛwala etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neeswoola mɛfulu. Tin, nyɛ ààkwyɛl ɛkat mɛzɔ mɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mɛ aadum nyɛ si kɔ goŋ mezuk. Mɛ waawa bot ɛ di egyee sama nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛzɔ ɔ tɔ boo mezuk. Yɛ di náá, bɛ eeswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ bet ɛdu ɛ nyɛ ɔɔ, mezuk mɛ tak aanàbela bɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mɛ waagó bɔn bɛ. Tin, ezɛɛga mendjaala djas aagu náá, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di egu esiiza nɛ mɛkwosak mɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Mɛ waadjɛ mot nɛ mot efute dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Tyatiid ɔɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ di ààdu mbee mɛlyo menek ɔɔ, biyɔ bot ɛ di ààsaa ɛgu ɛ́ sa di edjóoaa “esa e syela e Satan” ɔɔ, gwakeka sa mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen ɛ: mɛ ààpabaadjɛ bin dhiiti ɛbɛp. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Tin, sa bi zebela ɛ, mɛtka yɛ ghiŋ kɛkum ɛwala ɛ mɛ aazyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />É di'enek, nɛ mot aakwak ɔ, mot aasa ɛkwosak ɛ lam kɛkum dwoo mɛsik ɔ, mɛ waadjɛ nyɛ ghwyil kɔ membyak djas. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Nyɛ aadjɛɛd bɛ ɛ́ nɛ sek ghwooz, nyɛ waatwaal bɛ dáa mɛbhe mɛ dyak. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Saagam ɛ nadjɛ mɛghwyil tak. Mɛ waadjɛ mot aakwak ɔ kwyikwyen mɛlem.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Beta náá, mot di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Saaldɛs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Saaldɛs mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">Mot di nɛ esisim etɛn nɛ ebá e Zɛɛb, nɛ ekwyikwyen etɛn nɛ ebá ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ́: Mɛ nɛ gu mɛsa mɔ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ dék dáa mot di nɛ tsik ɔ, ghuna wɔ eezegwyɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Dia ndjem, djɛa mɛghaaz nɛ sa lik tɔ lɔ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛgwyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, mɛ eebee náá, wɔ tok nɛ embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ di ɛnyɔɛpe é mis ɛ Zɛɛb'am ɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Taala mɛlyo mɛ wɔ nazebela ɛ, nɛ tyee wɔ nazegwak ɛ. Dia sosoob nɛ yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ swoola mɛfulu mɔ. Tin, wɔ di ààdi ndjem ɔɔ, wɔ aasɛka mɛ pɛ daa lɔ ɛ́ zaka dáa mot djii, wɔ àànakwaagu ɛwala ɛ mɛ aatuula ɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />É di'enek, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyoog pɛ ghaada Saaldɛs di náá, bɛ ààpasa náá, ekaad bɔɔ ni mendi ɛ. É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛbɔt ɛ ekaad e na puu, étɛp bɛ neekɛ lɔɔg sama nɛ nam ɛ.<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Tin, nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, nyɛ waabɔt ekaad e na puu. É di'enek, mɛ aanàkwaadis din ɛ lɛ tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik, mɛ waamyaal é mis ɛ Saagam, nɛ é mis ɛ efofop náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngbam.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Beta náá, mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Filadhɛlfi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Filadhɛlfi mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">Mot edɛɛ, mot etsɛɛtsɛ lɛɛ ɛ́: nyɛ ɛ́ mot di nɛ sap ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid ɔ, é ghɛŋ nyɛ di edii ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛdiyal yɛ, é ghɛŋ nyɛ di ediyal yɛ ɛ, ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛdii yɛ: <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Mɛ nɛ gu mɛsa mɔ, sok bhwoob'ɔ mɛ eedii ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa di náá, dhiiti mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdiyal ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbuɛpe, é di'enek, wɔ eelooba nɛ mɛkpa mam, wɔ ààpaswonal mɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Beea sa mɛ aasa nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ Satan ɛ, bot ɛ di ekɔɔ bot náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, ghuna bɛ tok bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ: Mɛ waapus bɛ nɛ bhel náá, bɛ zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si mɛko mɔ étɛp bɛ neegu náá, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl wɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Dáa ye di náá, wɔ eelooba nɛ ɛtiŋ ɛ lam yii ɛdi ɛ nɛ zii ɛ, mam pe ɛ́ waabaal wɔ é ghɛŋ mezuk aazyɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs étɛp ɛwa bot tɔ mɛbhowal ɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Mɛ moo aazyɛ, baala sa wɔ di nɛ yɛ ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, etɛɛ náá, mot needi ààdɛk kɔtɔ duu yɔ.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ waasa náá, nyɛ di ɛgwyiŋ tɔ ndjaa-Zɛɛb'am, nyɛ aanàbaawyis tinaak. Mɛ waakwyal din ɛ Zɛɛb'am kɔ lɛ, dɔɔ nɛ din ɛ ghaada Zɛɛb'am, Yeluzalɛm na bes di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo pɛ daa Zɛɛb'am ɛ. Mɛ waakwyal dɔɔ nɛ din ɛ lam na bes pɛ kɔ lɛ.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Beta náá, mot di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Laodhise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />«Kwyala fofop zɛɛga mendjaala ghaada Laodhise mɛkana náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">Mot di edjóoaa <char style="sc">Amɛn</char> ɔ, sosoob tyaasɛs ɔ, etsɛɛtsɛ ɔ, mot mɛkɛn kɔ esa ee Zɛɛb nakus kɔ bhwak ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Mɛ nɛ gu mɛsa mɔ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ààtela, wɔ ààgoo pe. Ye waagoka ɛ́ náá, wɔ di tɔ mɛgoo nɛghu tɔ mɛtela! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Tin, dáa ye di náá, wɔ ààgoo, wɔ ààtela ɛ, dáa wɔ di pak mɛgoo nɛ mɛtela ɛ, mɛ waagó wɔ dáa mot di egó dhoo ɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ kum mot, mɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛvu, mɛ tok tɔ ɛsɛɛga ɛ dhiiti sonok.” É di'enek, wɔ ààgu mbi mot mezuk, mot mɛbɔs, djel mot, mot edhim, mot eduuba wɔ di ɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ mɛ di edjɛ wɔ mɛlyo náá, wɔ bɔm pɛ daa lam tɛtɛ lɔɔd di náá, yɛ eezedisaa mendi nɛ du ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ wɔ aadi tɛtɛ kum mot. Da wɔ ɛ́ baabɔm ekaad e na puu, étɛp ɛsyel nyel'ɔ, étɛp wɔ needi ààbɛ nɛ sen ɛdi ɛ́ ben toto. Wɔ ɛ́ bɔm dɔɔ nɛ met mɛ ɛgwom ɛ mis mɔ étɛp, wɔ neenyaasok. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Mɛ nɛ biyo nɛ bot ɛ mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, mɛ nɛ wa bɛ é feŋ. Tin, dia nɛ zii tɔ mɛsa, da wɔ ɛ́ swoola mɛfulu. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Gwaka, mɛ eetyaa é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa, mɛ ɛpediig. Mot ɛ gwak gwood'am, da nyɛ ɛ́ dii ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔɔ, mɛ waani tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Tin, mɛ waadɛ edee é di wat bis nɛ nɛ, nyɛy nɛ nam.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />É di'enek, nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ waasa náá, nyɛ di sama nɛ nam kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mam. Yɛ ɛ́ dáa mam, mɛ eekwak, bhii tak, mɛ eebe di sama nɛ Saagam kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Beta náá, mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak, sa Sisim di elɛɛ nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bot djas ɛpedjɛ duma nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Bhii tak, dhiiti sonok naazɛtelaa mɛ, wɔ gwaa mɛ zɛbee dhiiti ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa zokazɛbɛŋel pɛ tɔ gwoo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Tin, gwood mɛ nagwak elii nɛ nam sok ɛ, gwood nadi egek dáa tɔŋ ɛ, yɛ eezɛke nɛ nam: «Byeta pɛ kak, mɛ lyaal wɔ sa aatuula bhii tak ɛ.» <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Kasɛka ɛ́, Sisim eezɛmɛt mɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bóó mɛkoozi pɛ tɔ gwoo, kɔ bóó tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mot ndiindel. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Mot nadi ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi tak ɔ, bhwoob'ɛ nadi ɛ́ ɛkasɛpe dáa mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa yaspɛ nɛ saaldwan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yaspɛ nɛ saaldwan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ na tɔɔbelaa.</char></note> ɛ. É di'enek, dhiya na kas-kas dáa ɛkok ɛ di edjóoaa emelood<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">emelood </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛkok mɛtaŋ di nɛ mɛdii na dhɔɔ dáa mɛdii mɛ eka e kɔkɔ ɛ.</char></note> naadii bóó mɛkoozi tak. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />É mengwoob mɛ bóó mɛkoozi tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ edhiiti mɛbhóó mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená (24). Tin, pɛ kɔ mɛbhóó menek, bɛpaa mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená (24) nadi ɛ́ mendiindel kɔ tak. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ekaad e na puu é mɛnyel, nɛ ekɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ é elo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Mengwyes, bhyeed nɛ bɛghɛl ɛko nadi ewyis kɔ bóó mɛkoozi yenek. Sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ elama etɛn nɛ ebá nadi egoo ɛlyelɛpe ɛ, mengel mɛ elama binek ɛ́ esisim etɛn nɛ ebá ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi yenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti sonok ɛkɛɛ boo dii mɛsɔn ɛdjhaazɛpe dáa ɛkok ɛ mɛtaadak, dáa ɛkok na djhaaz-djhaaz.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Tin, kuku bóó mɛkoozi nɛ é mengwoob mɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ edhiiti membi mɛ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ. É mɛnyel mɔɔ, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ ebhum e mis pɛ mɛbhwoob nɛ pɛ ekoŋ bɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Djema di nɛ tsik ɔ, yii mɛkɛn pak'ɔɔ nadi enɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ boo ghee, yii bhɔɔba nadi enɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ mɔn ngɔmbɛ, yii elɛl, bhwoob'ɛ nadi ɛ́ dáa yii mot, yii ená, nakadi enɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ bhyel é pilal. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Pak edjema ená di nɛ tsik binɔk, ngɔt-ngɔt nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛbhap etɛn nɛ wat, mɛnyel mɔɔ nɛ si mɛbhap mɔɔ nadi ɛ́ kpeeeŋ nɛ mis é tak. Tin, mwos nɛ pum bɛ nadi edjeeb ààwala:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">«Dɛɛ, dɛɛ, dɛɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">nyɛy mot di ɔ, mot nadi ɔ, mot di ezyɛ ɔ!»<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />É mɛwala djas, edjema di nɛ tsik ɔ binɔk nadi edjeeb étɛp ɛdjɛ duma, nɛ duu, nɛ ɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ mot di ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, mot di nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />É mɛwala djas, bɛpaa mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená (24) naazɛghaaga si, sok bhwoob mot di pɛ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, bhii tak bɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ mɔɔ si, sok bhwoob mot di nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɔ. Bɛ naadis ekɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ bɔɔ, lóo yɛ sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi, bɔɔ eke náá:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />«Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb'es, wɔy ɛ́ di egoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">nɛ ɛdjɛaa duma, nɛ duu zɛnɔɔ mɛbwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">etɛɛ náá, wɔy ɛ́ nakus esonok djas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">esonok binek nakusaa ɛ́, é ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ!»<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Mɔn bhata nyɛy ɛmet ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdii mɛkana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Bhii tak mɛ eebee mɛkana wola dáa bum tɔ mbɔ mot nadi ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ. Mɛkana mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ekwyala tɔ tak nɛ é koŋ tak. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ tiŋela, nɛ mɛtuŋa etɛn nɛ ebá bɛ nabɛk luk kɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Bhii tak, mɛ eebaazɛbee dhiiti fofop na mɛbwala etuud ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ɛzɛ di egoka nɛ ɛkɔ mɛtuŋa mɛ nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ dii mɛkana?» <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mot pɛ tɔ gwoo, nɛ pɛ kɔ bɔs, zɛnɔɔ si bɔs nadi nɛ ghwyil ɛdii mɛkana, da laa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />É di'enek, mɛ moo tin edje ɛbuɛpe etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ dhiiti mot nadi egoka nɛ ɛdii mɛkana menek, da nyɛ ɛ́ laa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Tin, wɔ gwaa paa ngɔt zɛke nɛ nam náá: «Sa wɔ ààdje. Beea: Boo ghee bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, dha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid, nyɛ eekwak, nyɛ ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛdii mɛkana mɛ tsik nɛ ɛkɔ mɛtuŋa mɛtɛn nɛ ebá binek.» <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee Mɔn bhata ngɔt tetel é ngwoob bóó mɛkoozi, kuku ɛbwak ɛ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa. Mɔn bhata tak nadi ɛ́ tyee tit nagóaa étɛp buwa ɔ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ melak mɛtɛn nɛ ebá, nɛ mis mɛtɛn nɛ ebá. Mis mɛtɛn nɛ ebá binek lyaal ɛ, esisim etɛn nɛ ebá yii Zɛɛb nazedhis kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas ɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Wɔ gwaa, Mɔn bhata zɛtiila étɛp ɛzɛnɔɔ mɛkana nadi tɔ mbɔ eghɛŋ mot nadi ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />É ghɛŋ nyɛ nanɔɔ mɛkana ɛ, wɔ gwaa edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, nɛ bɛpaa mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená (24) zokazɛghaaga si, sok bhwoob Mɔn bhata. Mot nɛ mot nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ sandjo é mbɔ, nɛ ebɛɛlɛ nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ tɔɔɔ nɛ epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub di edikaa ɛ. Epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub yenek lyaal ɛ́ mendjaala mɛ bot ɛ na dɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Tin, bɛ nadi etii djeeb na bes:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">«Wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛnɔɔ mɛkana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">da wɔ ɛ́ kɔ mɛtuŋa nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Etɛɛ náá, wɔ naagóaa tyee buwa, nɛ ghiya yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">wɔ eepɛk bot étɛp Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">bot djas, membyak djas, elii djas, nɛ mɛdhik djas.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Wɔ eesa náá, bɛ di ɛyoŋ ɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb étɛp ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb'enaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">bɛ waakɔk kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas.»<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Mɛ nabaadi ɛ́ mɛ dinaa egwyák, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛgwak bhyeed mɛdhuu mɛ efofop: Ye nabɛ ɛ́ efofop mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu ààbɛ nɛ dáa laa. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ é mengwoob mɛ bóó mɛkoozi, nɛ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, nɛ bɛpaa tsii boma. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Bɛ nadi etsim ɛlyelɛpe náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">«Mɔn bhata nagóaa étɛp buwa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nyɛ ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛbela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">mɛbwala, nɛ mɛvu, nɛ etsoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nɛ ghwyil, duu, nɛ duma, nɛ mɛdjeeb!»<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Mɛ naabaagwak esa djas nakusaa di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ, nɛ esa ee di kɔ bɔs ɛ, nɛ esa di si bɔs ɛ, nɛ yii di tɔ eboo mɛdhii mɛ mɛsɔn ɛ, esa e bhwak djas nadi edjeeb náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">«Nɛ mot di ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ Mɔn bhata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">beta náá, mɛdjeeb, nɛ duu, nɛ duma, nɛ mɛbwala di nɛ nɛ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm!»<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Tin wɔ gwaa, edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, zɛbɔɔza: «<char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!» É di'enek, bɛpaa eezɛghaaga, da kwyit mɛboŋ si, étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Mɔn bhata.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Mɔn bhata eekɔ mɛtuŋa etɛn nɛ wat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee Mɔn bhata ékɔ ɛtuŋa mɛkɛn tɔ mɛtuŋa etɛn nɛ ebá bɛ nabɛk luk kɔ tak ɛ. Mɛ eezɛgwak djema ngɔt tɔ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, ebam ɛlyelɛpe dáa ghɛl ɛko náá: «Dha!» <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti yaaga na puu. Mot nadi kɔ tak ɔ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bhan é mbɔ, bɛ naadjɛ nyɛ kɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ dáa ghɛŋ mot, étɛp ɛbaakɛkwak kwaka sis.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />É ghɛŋ Mɔn bhata nakɔ ɛtuŋa yii bhɔɔba nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, mɛ eezɛgwak djema bhɔɔba pak edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, eke náá: «Dha!» <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Tin, dhiiti yaaga eezɛwyis, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa dáa du. Mot nadi kɔ tak ɔ, nyɛ naadjɛaa eghɛŋ ɛsaab ɛ egwyem ee nadi kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, étɛp bot neegónel pak'ɔɔ. É di'enek, boo pɛl naadjɛaa nyɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />É ghɛŋ Mɔn bhata nakɔ ɛtuŋa yii elɛl nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, mɛ eezɛgwak djema yii elɛl pak edjema di nɛ tsik ɔ eezɛke: «Dha!» Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti yaaga na dhɔɔ ezyɛ. Mot nadi kɔ tak ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ sa bɛ di etsel esonok étɛp ɛgu mɛdil mɛ tak ɛ é mbɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Bhii tak, mɛ naagwak tyee dhiiti gwood egék pak edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ. Gwood tak nadi eke ɛ́: «Kilo wat yii embɛɛ mɛbhek ɛ́ nɛ efute e dhenye wat. Tin, ekilo elɛl ebhum bɛ di edjóo ɔɔghɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ efute e dhenye wat. É di'enek, sa wɔ ààpul mul nɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin.»<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />É ghɛŋ Mɔn bhata nakɔ ɛtuŋa yii ená nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, mɛ eezɛgwak djema yii ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, eke náá: «Dha!» <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti yaaga na dhɔɔ ɛkɛɛ eka e kɔkɔ zesɔs ɛ. Mot nadi kɔ yaaga tak ɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ɛsyee, deenek, dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ nadi edu nyɛ pɛ bhis. Tin, ghwyil ɛgó ɛ bot naadjɛaa bɛ kɔ ba mɔɔ kyee bɔs wat tɔ mɛtsek mɛná, étɛp bɛ neegó bot nɛ pɛl, nɛ pwom edee, nɛ egum, zɛnɔɔ bɛtit ɛ bɛ na nyan-nyan di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />É ghɛŋ Mɔn bhata nakɔ ɛtuŋa yii etɛn nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, mɛ eezɛbee si mesa-ebuwa, esisim e bot ɛ nagóaa é buwa, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́ sosoob tɔ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛbaadi etyaasɛs e Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Bɛ nadi etsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Ghɛŋ mot edɛɛ, mot etsɛɛtsɛ, wɔ aaboopɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak den, étɛp ɛwa bɛ é feŋ etɛɛ náá, bɛ naagó bis?» <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />É di'enek, bɛ naadjɛ mot nɛ mot pak'ɔɔ lɔbɔ na puu. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ pookogwaal ba mɔɔ ɛwala batsa, kɛkum dwoo bɛ aabil mɛtaŋ mɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg nɛ bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi esa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bot ɛ di náá, bɛ aagóaa dáa bɔɔ ɔ.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee Mɔn bhata zɛkɔ ɛtuŋa etɛn nɛ wat nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ. Tin, wɔ gwaa bɔs zɛdheegel ɛlyelɛpe. É di'enek, gwyes moo ɛ́ suuut dáa kaad mot di nɛ pil ɛ. Tin, ngɔn moo ɛ́ tɔɔbelaa dáa ghiya. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Wɔ gwaa, ekwyikwyen di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, zɛkwyit pɛ kɔ bɔs ɛkɛɛ ebhum e le fiigh dinaa ààwoozal di ekwyit é bɔs nɛ ghuu ɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Tin, gwoo naazɛwol nyel dáa bɛ dyeebawol bum ɛ. Mɛtsok djas nɛ eghola djas naadisaa é edi nadidi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs, eboo ekukuma, ekukuma e esodja, bɛkum ɛ bot, bot ɛ di nɛ mɛbwala ɔ, nɛ ekwom e bot zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ di ààbɛ ekwom ɔ, bɔɔ djas naakɛsɔwa tɔ eboo eghu mɛkok pak mɛtsok nɛ tɔ ebat e mɛkok. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Tin, bɛ nadi eke nɛ mɛtsok nɛ ebat e mɛkok náá: «Bilaka kɔ les, syelka bis, étɛp bis needi ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ mot di pɛ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, bis needi ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛbuk ɛ Mɔn bhata. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Etɛɛ náá, boo ɛlu ɛ ɛbuk ɛ lɔɔ eezekum, tin ɛzɛ aakopyet?»<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Geka Zɛɛb nawa kɔ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ naazɛbee efofop ená metetel é etuma ená yii bɔs. Deenek, bɛ nadi esa náá, epup ee nadi edus pɛ edum e bɔs ɛ di ààpupal kɔ bɔs, ààpupal kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, ààkodeeg-deegak le wat. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Bhii tak, mɛ naabee dhiiti fofop edus pɛ kyee ɛdjem ɛ dwoo. É mbɔ'ɛ, nyɛ nadi emɛt geka wat yii Zɛɛb, mot di nɛ tsik ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbam ɛlyelɛpe nɛ efofop ená binɔk, bot ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ bɛ ghwyil étɛp ɛsa ɛbiyo kɔ bɔs nɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ náá: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />«Sa bi ààleesa sa ɛbiyo kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, nɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, nɛghu é le wat, ɛsok nɛ mena nɛ waka geka kɔ bhata-bhwoob bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb'enaka.» <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />É di'enek, mɛ naazɛgwak mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ nabela geka Zɛɛb é bhata-bhwoob'ɔɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bot bɛmil dhet nɛ bɛmil mɛkam-mɛná nɛ ɛná (144 000), tɔ bot ɛ membyak mɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl djas. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Tin, geka yenek nasaa ɛ́:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Lubɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:5">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Ghaad,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Asɛɛd,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Nɛftali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:6">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Manase,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Simeyɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Levi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:7">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Isakaad,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Zabulɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Zozɛf,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:8">tɔ bot bɛmil-kam nɛ bɛmil ɛbá (12 000) tɔ bil dɛl ɛ Bhɛzamɛ.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zukamwaa nɛ mot sok bóó mɛkoozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Bhii tak, mɛ naazɛbee zukamwaa nɛ mot, mɛtaŋ mɛ wat di náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlaŋ ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bot djas, membyak djas, elii djas, nɛ mɛdhik djas. Deenek, bɛ nadi ɛ́ metetel sok bóó mɛkoozi, sok bhwoob ɛ Mɔn bhata. Bɔɔ djas nabɔt ɛ́ elɔbɔ e na puu nɛ elɛɛ e mɛbhi é mɛmbɔ. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Bɛ nadi etsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Tsik dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb'enaka, mot di kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, nɛ Mɔn bhata!» <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Efofop djas naadii bóó mɛkoozi, nɛ bɛpaa, zɛnɔɔ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ. Bɛ naazɛkwyit mɛboŋ bhwoob si sok bóó mɛkoozi étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Bɔɔ eke:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">«<char style="sc">Amɛn</char>! Beta náá, mɛdjeeb, nɛ duma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">nɛ etsoŋ, nɛ ɛbulal ɛ bhɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">nɛ duu, nɛ mɛbwala, nɛ ghwyil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">di nɛ Zɛɛb'enaka kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!»<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ngɔt tɔ bɛpaa eezɛdji mɛ: «Bot ɛ zebɔt elɔbɔ na puu binɔk ɛ́ bɛzɛ? Bɛ dus paa?» <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Mɛ eezɛbɔɔza: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di egu, Ghɛŋ'am!» Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛke nɛ nam: «Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ naboma nɛ eboo mɛtiiga ɔ. Bɛ naagwyii elɔbɔ bɔɔ nɛ ɛsa náá, ye pum nɛ ghiya Mɔn bhata. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, bɛ di metetel sok bóó mɛkoozi ɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛduwal nyɛ mwos nɛ pum tɔ Di na Dɛɛ yɛ. Tin, mot di ndiindel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ waabaal bɛ é di tak. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Deenek, bɛ aanàbaagwak za nɛ gwyes mɛdii. Mɛkas mɛ gwyes nɛ belaa aanàdik bɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Etɛɛ náá, Mɔn bhata di kuku bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, nyɛ waabaal bɛ dáa mot di ebaal ebhata ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waadjɛɛd bɛ tɔ esɔɔgɔ ee di edjɛ tsik ɛ. É di'enek, Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ waasuŋal bɛ miŋal é mis.»<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Mɔn bhata eekɔ ɛtuŋa yii etɛn nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />É ghɛŋ Mɔn bhata nakɔ ɛtuŋa yii etɛn nɛ ebá nabɛkaa luk kɔ tak ɛ, wɔ gwaa, gwoo zɛdi kup tɔ ba mɔɔ pes ɛwala. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Tin, mɛ eezɛbee efofop etɛn nɛ ebá metetel sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb. Bɛ naazɛdjɛ bɛ etɔŋ etɛn nɛ ebá.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Dhiiti fofop eezɛtyaa é ngwoob mesa-ebuwa, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɔɔ buku nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd étɛp ɛdik epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub ɛ. Bɛ eezɛdjɛ nyɛ bɛtɛ nɛ epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub di edikaa ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neeka yɛ lɔɔg wat nɛ mendjaala mɛ bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, kɔ mesa-ebuwa nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd di sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi ɛ. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />É di'enek, eguluk ndika epu e ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub fofop dik ɛ, nadi edus tɔ mbɔ'ɛ, byet sok bhwood Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ mendjaala mɛ bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Tin, wɔ gwaa fofop zɛnɔɔ mɔɔ buku tak, nyɛ eezɛlwoodal yɛ nɛ du nyɛ nanɔɔ kɔ mesa-ebuwa ɛ, nyɛ eezɛwus yɛ kɔ bɔs. Wɔ gwaa, ghɛl ɛko zɛbam, bhyeed gék, mengwyes gwyes, bɔs dheegel.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efofop ená yii mɛkɛn ɛpelɔɔ tɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Tin, efofop etɛn nɛ ebá nadi nɛ etɔŋ etɛn nɛ ebá ɔ, nadi ekomsa étɛp ɛlɔɔ etɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Fofop mɛkɛn eezɛlɔɔ tɔŋ. Wɔ gwaa, bhi na bɛtɛ nɛ mɛtaadak nɛ du puuza nɛ ghiya zɛnɔ kɔ bɔs. Kyee wat tɔ mɛkɛɛ mɛlɛl bɔs, nɛ kyee wat tɔ mɛkɛɛ mɛlɛl ele, zɛnɔɔ eka e bes djas, naazɛdyak.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Bhii tak, fofop yii ebá eezɛlɔɔ tɔŋ. Dhiiti sonok tyee boo ɛtsok nɛ ngel kɔ tak naazɛghaaga tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Wɔ gwaa, kyee wat tɔ mɛkɛɛ mɛlɛl boo dii mɛsɔn zokazɛliiza ghiya. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, ɛdhuu ɛ wat tɔ mɛdhuu mɛlɛl mɛ edjema djas nadi nɛ tsik tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ, zokazɛgwyɛ. Dɔɔ nɛ kyee ɛdhuu ɛ wat tɔ mɛdhuu mɛlɛl mɛ mɛsuwa nadi kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɛ, zokazɛtwaalel.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Fofop yii elɛl naazɛlɔɔ tɔŋ, wɔ gwaa boo kwyikwyen zɛdus pɛ ɛko, bil pɛ si. Kwyikwyen tak nadi egel dáa boo ngel lama. Ye nadus ɛ́ pɛ ɛko, wɔ gwaa, ye zɛkwyit tɔ kyee wat eboo mɛdhii tɔ ekyee elɛl dɔɔ nɛ tɔ esɔɔgɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Din ɛ kwyikwyen tak nabɛ ɛ́ Absɛt<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Absɛt </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ din ɛ eka e na gwyee-gwyee.</char></note>. Kyee wat mɛdhii tɔ ekyee elɛl moo tin ɛgwyeeɛpe. É di'enek, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadɛ mɛdii mɛ tak ɔ naagwyɛ, etɛɛ náá mɛdii mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, ye moo nɛ sa di egó bot ɛ tɔ tak ɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Fofop yii ená eezɛlɔɔ tɔŋ. Wɔ gwaa, ye zɛnyuŋa é kyee wat tɔ ekyee elɛl e gwyes, nɛ kyee wat tɔ ekyee elɛl e ngɔn, baazɛnɔɔ kyee wat tɔ ekyee elɛl e ekwyikwyen. Tin, mwos tokapɛ nɛ kyee wat tɔ ekyee elɛl e mɛkas mɛ, pum pe tokapɛ nɛ kyee wat tɔ ekyee elɛl e mɛkas mɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Tin, mɛ eebaazɛgwyák, mɛ eebee bhyel wat é pilal pɛ ɛko, mɛ eegwak nyɛ etsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Haaa mezuk! Haaa mezuk! Haaa mezuk nɛ bot ɛ bɔs, é ghɛŋ efofop elɛl kalik ɔ aalɔɔ yɔbɔ etɔŋ ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Fofop yii etɛn eelɔɔ yɛ tɔŋ. Mɛ eezɛbee kwyikwyen wat edus pɛ ɛko, kwyit é bɔs. Kwyikwyen tak eedjɛaa sap boo guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Kwyikwyen tak eezɛdii boo guk tak, wɔ gwaa, eguluk etim tɔ tak. Eguluk tak nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ eguluk e boo du na bɔk-bɔk. Wɔ gwaa, gwyes nɛ pup zɛgwyiid nɛ eguluk binek. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Etsemaaka naazɛwyis tɔ eguluk binek, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdjaadela kɔ bɔs djas. Bɛ naadjɛaa mɛbwala mɛ di enɔŋel nɛ yii ebaalɔl ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Deenek, bɛ naalu bɛ náá, bɛ nàsaab eka nɛ ele, ààsaab-saabak edhiiti e mɛbhek. Tin, bɛ goka nɛ ɛzosa ɛbiyo ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ geka Zɛɛb kɔ ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Yɛ ààpadjɛaa bɛ ze náá, bɛ gó bot góak, bɛ zotiig bɛ ɛ́ tɔ bɛngɔn ɛtɛn. Tin, mezuk mɛ etsemaaka binɔk aasa nɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ, yɛ aakpaa dáa mɛkpaa mɛ ɛbaalɔl di ekwaal mot ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />É mɛlu menek, bot ɛ́ waasaa ɛsyee, ɛsyee aanàkwaazyɛ. Bɛ waakwyɛl náá, bɛ gwyɛ, tin, ɛsyee ɛ́ waakaab bɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Etsemaaka binɔk nadi ɛ́ dáa eyaaga ee zekomsaaa étɛp ɛkɛlumla dɛɛb ɛ. Elo bɔɔ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ekɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ nasaaa nɛ lɔɔd ɛ, mɛbhwoob mɔɔ nadi ɛ́ dáa yii bot. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Bhoo elo bɔɔ nadi ɛ́ dáa yii boa, mɛdjɛ mɔɔ nakadi ɛ́ dáa mɛdjɛ mɛ eboo bɛghee. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ebet bɔɔ nadi ɛ́ dáa ghun ghwooz. Ghuula mɛbhap mɔɔ nadi ɛ́ dáa ghuula embem e eyaaga di kɛlumla dɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Etsemaaka binɔk nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkɛɛz nɛ bɔɔ mɛgɔk é tak dáa ebaalɔl. Bɛ bela mɛbwala mɛ ɛzuk ɛ bot tɔ bɛngɔn ɛtɛn ɛ́ nɛ mɛkɛɛz menek. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Mɛkoozi mɔɔ ɛ́ fofop nadjɛaa boo guk na dim-dim ɔ. Tɔ lii Ebhele, bɛ djóo nyɛ ɛ́ Abadɔŋ, tɔ lii Ghɛlɛk bɛ djóo nyɛ ɛ́ «Apolyɔŋ», ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ «mot di epul ɔ».<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Mezuk mɛ mɛkɛn eezɛdhaa. Bhii tak, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ edhiiti mezuk mɛmbá di ebaazyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Bhii tak, fofop yii etɛn nɛ wat elɔɔ yɛ tɔŋ. Mɛ eezɛgwak gwood wat edus pɛ tɔ etuma ená yii mesa-ebuwa nasael nɛ lɔɔd, yii di sok bhwoob Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Tin, gwood'enek eezɛke nɛ fofop yii etɛn nɛ wat nadi emɛt tɔŋ ɔ náá: «Tiia efofop ená di kɔla é ngwoob boo soob na djato-djato di edjóoaa Efaalat ɛ.» <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />É di'enek, bɛ eezɛbet efofop ená nadi bɛ moo babeega étɛp ɛwala ɛlenek, étɛp dwoo ɛlenek, étɛp ngɔn'enek, étɛp mbu yenek, étɛp bɛ neekɛgó ɛdhuu ɛ bot wat tɔ mɛdhuu mɛlɛl nadi kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Bɛ naalɛɛ mɛ mɛtaŋ mɛ esodja bɔɔ di elumla dɛɛb kɔ eyaaga ɛ, mɛ nagwak ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ emiliyɔŋ bɛdhet-ɛbá. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Beeka dáa mɛ nabee eyaaga nɛ esodja bɔɔ kɔ tak tɔ dhyam ɛ: Bɛ nabɔt ɛ́ eghun e na tɔɔbelaa dáa du, dhɔɔ dáa ɛkok ɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa safiid ɛ, djemlaa dáa dhiiti mbi mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dhiiti mbi mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mɛsii mɛ tak djóoaa ɛ́ sufɛlɛ.</char></note> di edjóoaa sufɛlɛ. Elo eyaaga tak nadi ɛ́ dáa elo eboo bɛghee. Enuub bɔɔ wyisal ɛ́ du nɛ eguluk dɔɔ nɛ mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Du, eguluk, nɛ mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo, di ewyis tɔ enuub eyaaga ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ eboo egum elɛl nagó ɛdhuu wat tɔ mɛdhuu mɛlɛl mɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛbwala mɛ eyaaga ɛ́ tɔ enuub bɔɔ, nɛ tɔ mɛkɛɛz mɔɔ. Mɛkɛɛz mɔɔ ɛ́ dáa bɛnyɔ. Mɛkɛɛz mɔɔ tak ɛ nɛ elo étɛp ɛzuk ɛ bot.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Tin, bot ɛ nadi ààgwyɛ nɛ mezuk menek ɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ. Bɛ nadi eduduwal embee esisim, bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ, yii bɔɔ bɛmɛt nalul nɛ lɔɔd, nɛ gwooz di elulaa epata, nɛ gwooz di edjóoaa blɔɔz ɛ, zɛnɔɔ mɛkok, nɛ yii bɛ nakpak nɛ ele ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ esa ee di náá, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbee, ààgwak, ààkɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkat ɛgó ɛ́ bot, ɛsa bɛmɛsimba, ɛsa mɛzɔ nɛ ɛdjii.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Fofop nɛ mɔɔ mɛkana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti fofop na mɛbwala dhaa nyel edus pɛ tɔ gwoo, esul pɛ si. Eguud naabutal nyɛ dáa kaad. Tin, dhiya nadii nyɛ é lo. Bhwoob'ɛ nadi ekas dáa gwyes, mɛko nadi ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe dáa mɛgwyiŋ ekas dáa ngel du. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Tɔ mbɔ'ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɔɔ mɛkana mbek, nyɛ naakɛl ko eghɛŋ bɛ kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, ko ɛmyɛl ɛ lɛ kɔ bɔs. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Tin, nyɛ naazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe dáa boo ghee di ekɛɛd ɛ. Bhii nyɛ natsim ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bham bɛghɛl ɛko etɛn nɛ ebá zokazɛgék. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Bhii bham bɛghɛl ɛko, mɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛkwyal sa bham bɛghɛl ɛko nadi elii ɛ. Mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood tɔ gwoo eke: «Syela sa bham bɛghɛl ɛko ɛtɛn nɛ ɛbá binek lɛɛ wɔ ɛ, sa wɔ ààkwyal yɛ.»<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Wɔ gwaa, fofop mɛ nabee tetel kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, nɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ, zɛben mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ pɛ ɛko, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />tin, nyɛ eezɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb, mot di kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɔ, mot nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs, nɛ boo dii mɛsɔn, nɛ esa djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ. Fofop eezɛke: «Ɛwala ɛ tak ààkabɔya!» <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Tin, dwoo bot aagwak fofop yii etɛn nɛ ebá elɔɔ yɛ tɔŋ ɛ, esa e Zɛɛb nasyel bot ɛ bɔs ɛ, waanyen popoopwon. Yɛ aasael dáa nyɛ naloolɛɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ.<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Bhii tak, mɛ eebaagwak gwood mɛ nazegwak edus tɔ gwoo ɛ, yɛ eebaazɛlii nɛ nam liia sis: «Tɔ́, kɛnɔɔ mɔɔ mɛkana di mbek tɔ mbɔ ɛ fofop di tetel kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, nɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ.»<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Mɛ naazɛtiila pɛ daa fofop, mɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ djɛ mɛ mɔɔ mɛkana. Nyɛy nɛ nam náá: «Nɔŋa yɛ, da wɔ ɛ́ dɛ, ye waagwyee wɔ tɔ mɔ, tin, ye waases wɔ tɔ nuub dáa ego.»<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Mɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɔɔ mɛkana nadi tɔ mbɔ fofop ɛ, dɛ yɛ. Mɛses mɛ tak tɔ nuub'am nadi ɛ́ dáa ego. Tin, dáa mɛ namin yɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ɛgwyeeɛpe tɔ mɔ'am.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nam: «Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ baagoola-goola sis dáa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, sa Zɛɛb nakɛk nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekyee e mɛdhik, membyak, zɛnɔɔ elii, nɛ bɛmɛkoozi ɛ.»<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Bɛtyaasɛs ɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛdjɛ mɛ le ghwaazok di egekaa mɛdjaa mɛ esonok nɛ yɛ ɛ, ye nɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ mɔɔ bil le. É di'enek, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nam: «Wyɛla, tɔ́ kɛgek mɛdjaa mɛ Di na Dɛɛ e Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ mesa-ebuwa, da wɔ ɛ́ laa mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ di eduwal Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Tin, da wɔ ɛ́ bet ɛbɛsɛɛ mɛkɛn kok ndjaa-ebuwa ààgek yɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ naazedjɛ yɛ nɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis, bot aanyal ghaada na dɛɛ tɔ bɛngɔn mɛkam-mɛná nɛ ebá ɔ (42). <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mɛ waadhis bɛtyaasɛs bam bɛbá, bɛ waabɔt ekaad e pil. Bɛ waagoola bhaadal dus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ, mɛlu mil wat nɛ bɛdhet-ɛbá nɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ kam wat (1 260).»<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Bɛtyaasɛs binɔk bɛbá ɛ́ ele e oliv ebá, nɛ elama ebá di sok bhwoob Ghɛŋ nakuma bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛsa bɛ ɛbiyo ɔɔ, du ɛ́ waawyis tɔ enuub bɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ dik bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot aakwyɛl ɛsa bɛ ɛbiyo ɔ aagwyɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Bɛtyaasɛs binɔk ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbee bhi, é mɛlu djas bɛ aadi egoola bhaadal dus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛliig mɛdii zyɛ ghiya. Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, bhwak djas ni tɔ membi mɛ eboo egum djas, esok nɛ esok dáa elyem bɔɔ di ekwos ɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Tin, é ghɛŋ bɛ aasilal ɛgoola bhaadal yɔɔ ɛ, tit di ewyis tɔ boo guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɔ, waalumla dɛɛb nɛ nɔɔ. Nyɛ waakwak bɛ, nyɛ waagó bɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Myoŋ mɔɔ waakaaa é di bot djas di esɛɛga tɔ boo ghaada ɔ, di Ghɛŋ'ɔɔ nabemaa kɔ mɛlaaba ɔ. Di yenek lyaal ɛ́ ghaada Sodɔm nɛ kyee dik Eziptɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Bot djas, membyak djas, elii djas, nɛ mɛdhik djas ɛ́ waabee myoŋ mɔɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl nɛ pes. Tin, bɛ aanàmyaal náá, myoŋ mɔɔ kɛwaaa tɔ ɛvit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kɛwaaa tɔ ɛvit </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mɛvit mɔɔ nadidi ɛ́, tɔ ghu ɛkok kpaka.</char></note>. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Bot ɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ́ waamyaala nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɔɔ, bɛ aadi ɛ́ tɔ ɛbyoŋ, bɛ waapɛkel nɛ esa pak'ɔɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb bɛbá binɔk naadyeebaazuk bot.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Tin, bhii mɛlu mɛlɛl menek nɛ pes, eswos e tsik eezɛdus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ni tɔ lɔɔ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛwyɛl tyaa metetel, tin, bwoo naazɛmɛt bot ɛ nadi ebee bɛ ɔ ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb bɛbá binɔk naazɛgwak dhiiti boo gwood ebam pɛ tɔ gwoo: «Goka wak!» É di'enek, bɛ naabyet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo tɔ eguud, é mis mɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa bɔs zɛdheegel ɛlyelɛpe. Kyee wat tɔ ekyee kam ghaada zokazɛbik. Bot bɛmil ɛtɛn nɛ ɛbá (7 000) zokagwyɛ nɛ kukuu bɔs nadheegel ɛ. Bwoo naazɛsa bot ɛ natsak ɔ, é di'enek, bɛ naazɛdjɛ duu nɛ Zɛɛb, mot di tɔ gwoo ɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Mezuk mɛ bhɔɔba eedhaa, tin, mezuk mɛ elɛl moo aakan.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔŋ yii etɛn nɛ ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Tin, fofop yii etɛn nɛ ebá eezɛlɔɔ yɛ tɔŋ. Eboo bhyeed eezɛgék ɛlyelɛpe tɔ gwoo eke náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ bɔs'ak moo ɛ́ yii Ghɛŋ'es, nɛ Mɛsia mɛ. Nyɛ waakɔk kɔ bɔs kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm!» <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Tin, bɛpaa mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená, nadi mendiidel kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ ekukuma bɔɔ sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ eezɛghaaga bhwoob si, kwyit mɛboŋ mɔɔ étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">«Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">wɔy mot di ɔ, wɔy mot nadi ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">bis ɛpeghaapɛɛ wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">etɛɛ náá, wɔ eesa nɛ mɛbwala mɔ náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">mɛkoozi mɔ be di nenak.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Bot ɛ mɛdhik naakpaa ɛbuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nenak, yɛ ɛ́ ɛbuk ɛ lɔ ɛ kadi enyen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ɛwala ɛ ɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ eezedjala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Yɛ ɛ́ ɛwala ɛ wɔ aadjɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nɛ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ nɔ ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ di bɔ ɔ, efute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ye nakoozodi bot ɛ mbyok nɛghu bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyok ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ɛwala ɛ ɛsaab bot ɛ di esaab bɔs ɔ, yɛ eezedjala!»<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Pɛ tɔ gwoo, Di na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb naazɛbɛŋel, tin, tot ɛbhɛŋ zokatuula, mengwyes, bhyeed, bham ghɛl ɛko zɛgék, bɔs dheegel zɛnɔɔ bhi boo mɛtaadak nee.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Moma bɛ nɛ dhalaghɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Boo ndem wat naazɛtuula tɔ gwoo: dhiiti moma naabɔt gwyes é nyel dáa kaad, ngɔn nabɛ ɛ́ si mɛko mɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ kɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ na ekwyikwyen kam nɛ bɛbá kɔ lo. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛbum. Tin, ɛbɛl ɛ ɛbya nadi esa náá, nyɛ tsim ɛlyelɛpe.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Tin, wɔ gwaa dhiiti ndem sis baazɛtuula tɔ gwoo. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ boo dhalaghɔŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dhalaghɔŋ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">é ghɛŋ na mwa, dhalaghɔŋ nabɛ ɛ́ boo tit di esa bot ɛkɛɛd é mis ɛ.</char></note> na tɔɔbelaa dáa du. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ elo etɛn nɛ ebá, nɛ melak kam. Tin, kɔ elo etɛn nɛ ebá binek, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ ekɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ etɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Deenek, ɛkɛɛz ɛ lɛ nadi ewaabal ɛdhuu ɛ ekwyikwyen wat tɔ mɛdhuu mɛlɛl nadi tɔ gwoo ɔ, wɔ gwaa, ye mwas bɛ kɔ bɔs. Dhalaghɔŋ tak natyaŋ ɛ́ sok bhwoob moma nadi ekwyɛl ɛbya ɔ, étɛp nyɛ needɛ mɔn tak, é ghɛŋ nyɛ aabyel ɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="La femme et le Dragon" file="67_Rev12.1,3_Woman&amp;Dragon.tif" size="col" loc="12.4" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="12.4">Moma bɛ nɛ Dhalaghɔŋ</figure><verse eid="REV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Tin, moma tak naazɛbya mɔn mɔɔ motom. Mɔn tak ɛ waadjɛɛd bot ɛ membyak djas nɛ sek ghwooz. Mɔn tak naazɛbyet tɔ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb, pɛ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ di ɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Yɛ kabɛ moma ɔɔ, nyɛ naazɛkaab tɔ́, pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, pɛ pak Zɛɛb nazekoobal nyɛ di ɛ, étɛp nyɛ needjɛaa edee mɛlu mil nɛ bɛdhet-ɛbá nɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ kam wat (1 260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Bhii tak, tuub naazɛduuel tɔ gwoo. Kukuma efofop Mesɛl nɛ efofop bɛ naaduu nɛ dhalaghɔŋ. Tin, dhalaghɔŋ naabaangamela pɛ yɛ kyee nɛ efofop bɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naakwak dhalaghɔŋ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ di ɛdi tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Tin, boo dhalaghɔŋ naazyeegelaa, mwasaa pɛ si. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di nyɔ na mwa. Nyɛy ɛ di edjóoaa Satan nɛghu dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot di esa náá bot ɛ bɔs wo ze ɔ. Bɛ naazemwas nyɛ bɛ nɛ efofop bɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛgwak gwood wat etsim ɛlyelɛpe tɔ gwoo, eke náá: «Nenak, ye moo ɛ́ ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb di etsik bot ɛ! Nenak, Zɛɛb'enaka eelyaal mɛbwala mɛ, nyɛ eesa náá, ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ di. Nenak, mɛkoozi mɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛmbɔ ɛ Mɛsia. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naazedis mot di epit bɔn-nyɛɛg bina mwos nɛ pum pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔ, mwas nyɛ pɛ si. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bina eekwak nyɛ dum nɛ ghiya ɛ Mɔn bhata nɛ mɛkpa mɛ bɛ di egoola ɛ. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛɛg mɛnyel mɔɔ, bɛ naamyaal ɛgel mɛnyel mɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, dika tɔ mɛmyaala, wɔy gwoo nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di tɔ gwoo ɔ! Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ, bɔs nɛ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔɔ, haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ nen! Dim mot mɛkɔŋ moo ɛ́ kɔ len, nɛ ɛbuk dhaa tyɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛlu mɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs kalik ɛ́ batsa!»<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Dáa dhalaghɔŋ nabee náá, nyɛ naazyeegelaa, mwasaa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛdu moma nabya mɔn mɔɔ motom ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Tin, moma naazɛdjɛaa eboo mɛbhap mɛmbá yii bhyel. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp nyɛ neepilal, kɛkum é di bɛ nazekoobal nyɛ yɛ ɛ pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, é di nyɛ aadjɛaa edee membu mɛlɛl nɛ pes ààkunaa nɛ nyɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɔ tak zɛgó dhoo mɛdii nɛ mɛdii ɛbuɛpe, dáa boo dii bhii koŋ moma yenɔk, étɛp moma neewo tɔ dii tak. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Tin, wɔ gwaa, bɔs zokazyɛ zɛtsik moma. Bɔs eezɛbɛɛ nuub, min bɛtɛ nɛ mɛdii mɛ dhalaghɔŋ nagó tɔ nuub'ɛ ɛ djas. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Tin, dhalaghɔŋ naazɛkpaa ɛbuk nɛ moma, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtɔ́ kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn moma di elooba nɛ mɛtiŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ sosoob nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e bhaadal ɛ Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />É di'enek, dhalaghɔŋ nazɛtɔ́ kɛtyaa kɔ bɛsyɛ é ngwoob boo dii mɛsɔn.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Bɛtit ɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti tit wat ewyis tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ melak kam, nɛ elo etɛn nɛ ebá. Kɔ melak kam yenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ekɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ kɔ tak. Pɛ kɔ elo binek, ye nabaadi ɛ́ nɛ ekwyala e min di elee Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Tit mɛ nabee ɛ́ nadi enɔŋel nɛ ghee, mɛko mɛ nadi ɛ́, dáa mɛko mɛ tit di edjóoaa ulsɛ ɛ, nuub'ɛ nakadi ɛ́ dáa yii boo ghee. Dhalaghɔŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye baabelaa ɛ́ tɔ ɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12:3">12.3</ref></char>.</char></note> naazɛdjɛ tit'enɔk mɛbwala mɛ, nɛ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ, zɛnɔɔ boo eghɛŋ bɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Lo wat tɔ elo e tit'enɔk nadi ɛ́ nɛ pyoŋ ɛkɛɛ bɛ naabi nyɛ dhaa tyɛ, sa ɛkunaa nɛ ɛsyee. Tin, pyoŋ tak naazɛgel. Deenek, bhwak djas naadyeebamyaala nɛ nɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ du nyɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Tin, bot djas nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo eduwal dhalaghɔŋ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadjɛ eghɛŋ nɛ tit. Bot djas nabaadi eduwal tit, bɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ di enɔŋel nɛ tit, ɛzɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ nɛ?»<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Tit naabela ghwyil ɛwyisal mɛkpa mɛ ɛbet, nɛ ɛnyek din ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ nazɛbela ghwyil ɛsa deenek ɛ́ tɔ bɛngɔn mɛkam-mɛná nɛ ebá (42). <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Tin, nyɛ moo enyek Zɛɛb, elee din ɛ lɛ, lee dɔɔ nɛ Di na Dɛɛ yɛ, zɛnɔɔ sa djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Nyɛ naabaladjɛaa ze ɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, da kwak bɛ. Nyɛ naadjɛaa eghɛŋ kɔ bot djas, membyak djas, elii djas, nɛ mɛdhik djas. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Tin, bot djas kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ́ waaduwal nyɛ, bot ɛ di náá, min mɔɔ tok kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik kana bɔs nakusel ɛ. Mɛkana mɛ tsik tak ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ Mɔn bhata nakaaa buwa ɔ.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />«Mot ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, nyɛ gwak ɛnyɔɛpe! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Mot ɛ di náá, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ mot membok ɔɔ, nyɛ waani é mbok. Mot ɛ di náá, nyɛ aagwyɛ ɛ́ nɛ pɛl ɔɔ, nyɛ aazogwyɛ ɛ́ nɛ pɛl. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ zii nɛ ɛdum ɛkoŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti tit é wyis tɔ bɔs. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ melak mɛmbá dáa yii mɔɔ bhata, tin, nyɛ nadi elii ɛ́ dáa dhalaghɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ e tit mɛkɛn djas, nyɛ nadi etel eghɛŋ binek ɛ́ é mis mɛ tit'enɔk. Nyɛ nadi ebesal bɔs nɛ bot ɛ di kɔ bɔs ɔ náá, bɛ duwal tit mɛkɛn nabaalaa boo pyoŋ nawaagó nyɛ, da yɛ ɛ́ gel ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Deenek, tit nawyis tɔ bɔs ɔ nadi esa eboo esa e mɛbwala. Nyɛ naabatasa náá, du dus tɔ gwoo, sul é bɔs é mis mɛ bot djas. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Deenek, nyɛ nadi ekɔɔ bot ɛ bɔs nɛ endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ nadi esa é mis mɛ tit mɛkɛn ɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ kpak naghisɛ étɛp ɛduwal tit nabaalaa nɛ pɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ tsak ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Tin, tit bhɔɔba yenɔk naadjɛaa ghwyil ɛsa náá, naghisɛ yenɔk di nɛ tsik, ye lii, da yɛ ɛ́ gó bot djas di ààduwal yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />É di'enek, tit'enɔk naazɛbesal bot djas, bot ɛ di nɛ mbyok nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mbyok ɔ, djel mot nɛ kum mot, kwom nɛ mot di ààdi kwom ɔ, náá, bɛ waaa geka kɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ eghɛŋ bɔɔ nɛghu kɔ ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Deenek, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbɔm nɛghu ɛbɔmsa dhiiti sonok, nyɛ di ààdi nɛ geka yenek ɔ, nɛghu din ɛ tit, nɛghu mɛtaŋ mɛ di enɔŋel nɛ din ɛ lɛ ɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Deenek, ye goka ɛ́ mot di nɛ etsoŋ. Mot ɛ di etselal ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu sa ɛlɛɛga ɛ tit'enɔk di elɛɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, ɛlɛɛga ɛlenek ɛ́ ɛlɛɛga ɛ din ɛ mot. Ɛlɛɛga ɛ tak ɛ́ bɛdhet-ɛtɛn nɛ wat nɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat nɛ etɛn nɛ wat (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mɔn bhata nɛ bot ɛ zebaabela tsik ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Mɛ nadi ebaabee, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛbee Mɔn bhata tetel kɔ ɛtsok ɛ Siyɔŋ. É di nyɛ nadi ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot bɛmil dhet nɛ bɛmil mɛkam-mɛná nɛ ɛná (144 000), nadi nɛ din ɛ lɛ nɛ yii Sɛɛg kwyala kɔ ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood tɔ gwoo é swak dáa eboo mɛsok, dáa boo bham ghɛl ɛko. Tin, ɛtap ɛ mɛ nagwak ɛ nadi ɛ́ dáa yii bot ɛ di ebwom ngɔmbi ɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot binɔk nadi etii djeeb na bes sok bhwoob bóó mɛkoozi, sok bhwoob edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa. Mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjek djeeb tak, yɛ di ààbɛ bot bɛmil dhet nɛ bɛmil mɛkam-mɛná nɛ ená (144 000) nadi kɔ bɔs ɔɔ, bot ɛ Mɔn bhata natsik ɔ.<verse eid="REV 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Bot binɔk nabɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ nadi ààsaab mɛnyel mɔɔ nɛ mɛzɔ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, bɛ naabaal mɛnyel mɔɔ tɔ edɛɛ. Bɛ ɛpedu Mɔn bhata é edi djas nyɛ di etɔ́ ɛ. Bɛ naadjɛaa tsik tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, étɛp bɛ needi bot ɛ mɛkɛn aadjɛaa Zɛɛb bɛ nɛ Mɔn bhata ɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Bɛ ààwyisal etɛp e etsal tɔ enuub bɔɔ, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil kwyeselaa ndjɛ sɔs.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efofop elɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Bhii tak, mɛ naazɛbee dhiiti fofop epilal ɛvyɛɛgɛpe pɛ tɔ gwoo. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal na kɔm-kɔm nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgoola nɛ bot ɛ bɔ djas, membyak djas, elii djas, nɛ mɛdhik djas ɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Nyɛ nadi etuud ɛlyelɛpe ɛ́ náá: «Kaabka Zɛɛb, djɛka nyɛ duma! Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala nyɛ di epɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs ɛ, yɛ eezedjala. Duwalka mot nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs ɔ, mot nakus boo dii mɛsɔn nɛ esɔɔgɔ djas ɔ!»<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Fofop bhɔɔba nadi edu fofop mɛkɛn ɔ nadi eke náá: «Yɛ eewyɛɛza, boo ghaada Bhabhilɔn eewyɛɛza! Nyɛy mot di edjɛ bot ɛ mɛdhik djas mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ gwam-gwam mɛzɔ mɛ ɔ!»<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Tin, fofop yii elɛl, mot nadi ebɔɔba bɛbá binɔk ɔ, nadi etsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Mot ɛ duwal tit nɛ naghisɛ yɛ ɔɔ, da nyɛ ɛ́ bela geka kɔ bhata-bhwoob nɛghu kɔ mbɔ ɔɔ, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />nyɛy pe ɛ́ waadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ boo ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ tak aadi ɛ́ na nyan-nyan, tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waaso yɛ tɔ mɔɔ buku ɛbuk ɛ lɛ. Deenek, nyɛ waabee boo mezuk tɔ du nɛ mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo di djóoaa sufɛlɛ ɛ, é mis mɛ efofop na dɛɛ, dɔɔ nɛ é mis mɛ Mɔn bhata. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Eguluk e du di ezuk bɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛpebyet pɛ ɛko kɔm-kɔm. Bot ɛ di eduwal tit nɛ naghisɛ yɛ ɔ, bot ɛ bela geka din ɛ lɛ é bhata-bhwoob ɔ, bɛ ɛpeni tɔ mezuk mwos nɛ pum, ààbɛ nɛ ɛwala.»<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, bot ɛ edɛɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlyaal náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ zii, bɛ nɛ looba nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ ɛpedum koŋ nɛ Yezu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood tɔ gwoo eke nɛ nam: «Kwyala dáak:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 14:13">“Kana mos, mɛmyaala nɛ bot ɛ di egwyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 14:13">bɔɔ tɔ mɛsa mɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 14:13">Deenek, Sisim lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 14:13">“Mɛmyaala nɛ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 14:13">Bɛ eebela ɛwala dum nɛ elyel-lyel mɛsa mɛ bɛ nasa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 14:13">etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabela efute e mɛnyɔ mɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛ nazesa ɛ!”»<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbu ɛdis ɛ mɛbhek kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Mɛ nadi ebaagwyák, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛbee eguud na puu. Tɔ eguud tak, mɛ naabee dhiiti mot é nɔŋel nɛ mɔn mot. Nyɛ nabɔt kɔ lo ɛ́ kɔtɔ bɛghɛŋ nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ, é mbɔ yɛ, nyɛ namɛt ɛ́ ɛghɔɔb wat na wol-wol. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Tin, dhiiti fofop eezɛwyis tɔ Di na Dɛɛ, nyɛ eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe nɛ mot nadi ndiidel tɔ eguud ɔ náá: «Nɔŋa ɛghɔɔb ɛ lɔ, disa mɛbhek, etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛ tak eezedjala, mɛbhek mɛ bɔs eezewoozal étɛp ɛdis!» <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />É di'enek, mot nadi ndiidel kɔ eguud ɔ naazɛwus ɛghɔɔb ɛ lɛ kɔ bɔs, tin, mɛbhek mɛ bɔs djas naadisaa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Dhiiti fofop sis naazɛwyis tɔ Di na Dɛɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ, nyɛy pe nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ yɛ ɛghɔɔb na wol-wol é mbɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Dhiiti fofop sis, mot di nɛ ekukuma kɔ du ɔ naazɛdus pɛ kyee mesa-ebuwa. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe nɛ mot nadi nɛ ɛghɔɔb na wol-wol ɔ náá: «Nɔŋa ɛghɔɔb ɛ lɔ na wol-wol, tsaala mɛghɛŋ mɛ bhum vin di kɔ bɔs ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bhum e tak eezewoozal.» <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Fofop tak naazɛdhaa nɛ ɛkpaŋ ɛ́ mɛghɛŋ mɛ bhum vin nadi kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ nɛ ɛghɔɔb ɛ lɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛso yɛ djas tɔ syaala di elyaal ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Bhum e vin natwaalaa ɛ́ tɔ syaala di ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ghaada ɛ. Tin, ghiya nadi eswol tɔ syaala. É di'enek, yɛ eezɛwo kɛkum ekilomɛtɛlɛ bɛdhet ɛlɛl (300). Tin, ghiya nadi ebyet, mɛdim mɛ tak ɛkɛɛ yɛ aasik yaaga é tsuŋ.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Efofop etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ egum e mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti boo ndem sis tɔ gwoo, mɛ naadjoka. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, efofop etɛn nɛ ebá ɛ nazyɛ nɛ egum etɛn nɛ ebá. Yɛ ɛ́ egum mɛsik, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mezuk menek ɛ, ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb aadjala. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Bhii tak, mɛ eebaabee kwaambi dhiiti boo dii mɛsɔn edjhaazal dáa ɛkok ɛ mɛtaadak, boo dii tak ɛ́ puuza nɛ du. Tin, bot djas nakwak tit nɛ naghisɛ, nɛ ɛlɛɛga ɛ di elyaal din ɛ lɛ ɔ, bɛ nadi ɛ́ metetel é ngwoob boo dii mɛsɔn menek. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ engɔmbi ee Zɛɛb nadjɛ bɛ ɛ é mɛmbɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Bɛ nadi etii djeeb ɛ Moiiz mot-mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ djeeb ɛ Mɔn bhata:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">«Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">mɛsa mɔ nɛ bɔk, ye nɛ nyɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Wɔ ɛ́ Mɛkoozi mɛ membyak djas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">étɛp bɔ ɛ́ epiki nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ɛzɛ aakodi ààkaab wɔ Ghɛŋ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ɛzɛ aakopɛɛ ɛdjɛ wɔ duma?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy, wɔ ɛmet ɛ di dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">bot ɛ membyak djas ɛ́ aazyɛ zɛduwal wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">etɛɛ náá, mɛsa mɛ epiki bɔ naazelyaalaa bɛ popoopwon.»<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee Di na Dɛɛ di nɛ pɛt ɛbhɛŋ tɔ tak ɛ, ebɛŋel pɛ tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Deenek, efofop etɛn nɛ bɛbá ee nadi emɛt egum é mɛmbɔ ɔ naazɛwyis tɔ Di na Dɛɛ di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ. Bɛ naabɔt embɛɛ ekaad e na puu ekas dhaa tyɛ, nɛ embaab nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ, epɛta é kuu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ngɔt tɔ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ naazɛdjɛ efofop etɛn nɛ bɛbá bɔɔ ebuku etɛn nɛ ebá nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ, tɔɔɔ nɛ ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy mot di nɛ tsik kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm ɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Eguluk naalwood tɔ Di na Dɛɛ. Eguluk binek lyaal ɛ́ mɛbwala nɛ duma ɛ Zɛɛb. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mot nadi nɛ ghwyil ɛni tɔ Di na Dɛɛ, kɛkum dwoo egum etɛn nɛ ebá yii efofop nazyɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ, aadjala ɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Ebuku etɛn nɛ ebá ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ naagwak boo gwood pɛ tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa eke nɛ efofop etɛn nɛ ebá binɔk náá: «Tɔ́ka, kɛsoka ebuku yii ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs!»<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Deenek, fofop mɛkɛn naazɛtɔ́ kɛso sa nadi tɔ mɔɔ buku yɛ ɛ kɔ bɔs. Wɔ gwaa, embee mɛpyoŋ nakpaa-kpaa zɛsee é mɛnyel mɛ bot ɛ nadi nɛ geka tit ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi eduwal naghisɛ yɛ ɔ, na kpeeeŋ.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Tin, fofop yii bhɔɔba naakɛso sa nadi tɔ mɔɔ buku yɛ ɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. É di'enek, boo dii mɛsɔn moo tin zoooŋ dáa ghiya mot zegwyɛ ɔ. Tin, edjema djas nadi nɛ tsik tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ naazɛsi bhɛɛɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Fofop yii elɛl naazɛso sa nadi tɔ yɛ mɔɔ buku ɛ tɔ eboo mɛdhii nɛ tɔ esɔɔgɔ. É di'enek, yɛ eezɛliiza ghiya. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Tin, mɛ eezɛgwak fofop nadi nɛ ghwyil ɛkɔk kɔ mɛdhii ɔ, eke náá: «Wɔy Mot edɛɛ, wɔy Mot di ɔ, wɔy Mot nadi ɔ, deenek, wɔ eelyaal náá, wɔ pɛ́ɛ ɛ́ tɔ epiki. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Dáa ye di náá, bot binɔk naaso ghiya bot ɛ edɛɛ, nɛ yii bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nenak, wɔ eedjɛ bɛ ghiya náá, bɛ dɛ, bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ saa yɛ!» <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood edus pɛ kyee mesa-ebuwa, eke náá: «Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake, mɛ nɛ gu náá, epɛ́ɛ bɔ ɛ́ epɛ́ɛ e tsɛɛtsɛ, yɛ ɛ́ yii epiki!»<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Deenek, fofop yii ená naaso sa nadi tɔ yɛ mɔɔ buku ɛ, kɔ gwyes. É di'enek, gwyes naabela ze ɛgó ɛ bot ɛ bɔs nɛ du'ɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Bot ɛ bɔs naadikaa nɛ mbee mɛgoo mɛ du. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo elee din ɛ Zɛɛb, mot di nɛ ghwyil kɔ egum binek ɔ. Tin, bɛ naabyen ɛswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛdjɛ duma nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Fofop yii etɛn naaso sa nadi tɔ yɛ mɔɔ buku ɛ kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɛ tit. Wɔ gwaa, mbee mɛghomela zɛni tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ. Bot nadi ekwaal mɛtsok, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ezuk. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />É di'enek, bɛ moo lee din ɛ Zɛɛb mot di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mezuk nɛ mɛpyoŋ mɔɔ. Tin, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkat ɛsa embee mɛsa mɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Fofop yii etɛn nɛ ngɔt naaso sa nadi tɔ yɛ mɔɔ buku ɛ, tɔ boo dii di edjóoaa Efaalat ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, boo dii tak zɛgel djas, étɛp ɛdjɛ ze nɛ bɛmɛkoozi nadus pɛ kyee ɛdjem ɛ dwoo ɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee embee esisim elɛl enɔŋel nɛ bɛnagba. Tɔ embee esisim e tak, ngɔt nawyis ɛ́ tɔ nuub dhalaghɔŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dhalaghɔŋ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye baabelaa ɛ́ tɔ ɛlaŋel <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12:3">12.3</ref></char>.</char></note>, dhiiti tɔ nuub tit, zɛnɔɔ nwyak ngɔt tɔ nuub ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Embee esisim tak nabɛ ɛ́ esisim ɛ Satan nadi esa mɛvyɛkɛlɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ. Embee esisim binɔk bɛlɛl naazɛtɔ́ kɛsɛɛg bɛmɛkoozi mɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas ɔ, étɛp ɛkɛlumla dɛɛb é boo ɛlu ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Ghɛŋ eezɛke: «Gwaka, mɛ aazyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot djii! Mɛmyaala nɛ mot aadi ndjem ɔ, mot aadi nɛ ekaad é nyel ekaab náá, nyɛ ɛzɛkɛtɔ́ syɛɛɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ gwak sen, etɛɛ náá, bot eebee nyɛ syɛɛɛ ààbɛ nɛ ekaad.»<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Esisim binek naasɛɛg bɛmɛkoozi é di wat di edjóoaa tɔ lii eBhele «<char style="sc">Almaghedɔŋ</char>» ɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Fofop yii etɛn nɛ ebá naaso yɛ sa nadi tɔ mɔɔ buku ɛ, tɔ pup. Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti gwood zɛgék ɛlyelɛpe tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa, edus pɛ kyee bóó mɛkoozi Zɛɛb, eke náá: «Nenak, esa djas eezedjala!» <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Wɔ gwaa, mengwyes zɛgwyes, boo ebhyeed zɛgék, bham bɛghɛl ɛko zɛbam, bɔs naadheegel ɛlyelɛpe. Tin, ye naadyeebadheegel ɛlyelɛpe, dheegelak wat di náá, kana ɛlu ɛ mot nakusaa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ dinaa ààpabee kwaambi yenek dheegela. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Boo ghaada naazɛtsek é esum elɛl. Tin, eghaada e bot ɛ mɛdhik djas naazɛbik. É di'enek, Zɛɛb naazɛtaala boo ghaada Bhabhilɔn, étɛp nyɛ needjɛ nyɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin boo ɛbuk ɛ lɛ, nyɛ dɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Eghola djas di tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ naades, bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabee mɛtsok. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Eboo mɛkok mɛ mɛtaadak mɛ na dil-dil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mɛkok mɛ mɛtaadak mɛ na dil-dil </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛdil mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ekilo mɛkam-mɛná. </char></note> naazɛdus pɛ tɔ gwoo bila bot kɔ mɛnyel. Tin, bot naazɛlee din ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ gum bhi eboo mɛtaadak menek. Etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ gum nadi nɛ mbee ghulal ɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Epɛ́ɛ e moma na ghaa-mɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Fofop ngɔt tɔ efofop etɛn nɛ ebá nadi nɛ bɔɔ ebuku etɛn nɛ ebá é mɛmbɔ ɔ, naazyɛ zɛlɛɛ mɛ náá: «Dha, mɛ tel wɔ feŋ moma na ghaa-mɛzɔ aabela ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ boo ghaada di suma é ngwoob bɛtɛ nɛ boo mɛdhii ɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak naaso mɛnyel tɔ mɛzɔ bɛ nɛ moma tak, bot ɛ bɔs nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo tɔ elangi e mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ mɛzɔ mɛ.»<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Tin, Sisim naazɛmɛt mɛ, wɔ gwaa, fofop zɛnɔɔ mɛ tɔ́ nɛ nam pɛ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. É di'enek, mɛ naazɛbee dhiiti moma ndiidel kɔ tit na zoooŋ. Nyel'ɛ nadi ɛ́ kpeeeŋ nɛ ekwyala e min mɛ di enyek Zɛɛb ɛ. Tit tak nadi ɛ́ nɛ elo etɛn nɛ ebá, zɛnɔɔ melak kam. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Moma tak nabɔt ɛ́ ekaad e ghoŋ na zoooŋ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛvunga, nɛ mɛsum mɛ nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ, nɛ mɛkok e mɛtaŋ zɛnɔɔ bɛmɛyaka. É mbɔ'ɛ, nyɛ namɛt ɛ́ mɔɔ buku nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ tɔɔɔ nɛ embee esesɛɛ, nɛ edhuud e mɛzɔ mɛ nyɛ di esa ɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Tin, bhata-bhwoob'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ kwyala din. Sa nadi syela tɔ din ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́: «Boo ghaada Bhabhilɔn ɛ́ nyɛɛg boa mɛzɔ nɛ embee esesɛɛ ee di esael kɔ bɔs djas ɛ.» <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Mɛ naabee náá, moma mɛzɔ tak nadi ɛ́, tɔ elangi e ghiya bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ ghiya bot ɛ nazegóaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ esosoob bɔɔ nɛ Yezu ɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Beea mɛ nabee nyɛ ɛ, mɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Tin, fofop eezɛke nɛ nam náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di edjoka? Mɛ waatel wɔ etɛp ee di syela dum nɛ moma yak, nɛ tit di ebɛp nyɛ yenɔk, mot di nɛ elo etɛn nɛ ebá, nɛ melak kam yenɔk. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Tit wɔ di ebee yenɔk nadi ɛ́ nɛ tsik, nenak yak, nyɛ tokapɛ nɛ tsik. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwyis tɔ boo guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɔ, tin, nyɛ waagóaa nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. Bot ɛ di náá, min mɔɔ tok kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik kana bhwak nɛ ɛkusel ɔ, bɛ waadjoka beea bɛ aabee tit ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi sok ɛ́ nɛ tsik, nenak nyɛ eezegwyɛ, tin, nyɛ waabaatuula.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Wak, ye goka ɛ́ mot di nɛ mɛtselal nɛ etsoŋ. Elo etɛn nɛ ebá binek ɛ́ mɛtsok mɛtɛn nɛ ebá yii moma yenɔk di ndiidel kɔ tak ɛ. Ye baalyaal ɛ́ bɛmɛkoozi mɛtɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Pɛ tɔ bɛmɛkoozi mɛ tak, bɛtɛn naazegwyɛ. Nenak ngɔt ɛ́ kalik kɔ bóó mɛkoozi. Mot aadi mɛkoozi mɛ yii etɛn nɛ ebá ɔ, nyɛ dinaa ààpazyɛ. É sok nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ, nyɛ aanàkwaadyeebabɔya. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Tit nabɛ é ghɛŋ sok, kadi mos náá, nyɛ tokapɛ ɛ, nyɛy, nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di mɛkoozi mɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl. Nyɛ ɛ́ pe ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ sama bɛmɛkoozi mɛtɛn nɛ ebá, tin, nyɛ moo aagwyɛ.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Melak kam wɔ bee yenek, yɛ ɛ́ bɛmɛkoozi kam, bɛmɛkoozi mɛ tak dinaa ààpadilaa kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi mɔɔ. Tin, bɛ waabela eghɛŋ ɛkɔk é ɛwala wat nɛ tit yenɔk. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Bɔɔ djas ɛ́ nɛ esiiza wat, bɛ ɛpedjɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛbwala mɔɔ nɛ tit. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Bɛ waaduu nɛ Mɔn bhata, tin, Mɔn bhata ɛ́ waakwak bɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ bɛghɛŋ, nyɛ ɛ́ Mɛkoozi mɛ bɛmɛkoozi. Deenek, nyɛ waakwak bɛ nɛ bot bɛ djas nyɛ nazedjóo nɛ ɛsɛ́ɛ ɔ, bot ɛ di sosoob nɛ nɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />É di'enek, fofop eebaake nɛ nam: «Mɛdhii mɛ wɔ bee yenek, é di moma mɛzɔ di yenek, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ bɔs, yɛ ɛ́ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ mɛdhik djas zɛnɔɔ elii djas. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Melak kam, nɛ tit wɔ bee ɛ, bɛ waabhina moma mɛzɔ. Bɛ waadjii nyɛ ekum djas, tin bɛ waanɛɛg nyɛ syɛɛɛ ààbɛ nɛ ekaad, bɛ waadɛ epuud bɛ, yii yɛ aabwak ɛ, bɛ waamwas yɛ tɔ du. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naawa tɔ ebhum e lyem bɔɔ, egwyes ɛsa ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ. Tin, bɔɔ djas ɛ́ waagwakel náá, bɛ nɔɔ ghwyil nɛ ekukuma bɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ sa mɛsa mɛ tit nɛ yɛ, kɛkum ɛwala di náá, esa ee di kwyala tɔ mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb aasael ɛ.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Deenek, moma wɔ bee'aak, yɛ ɛ́ boo ghaada di ekɔk kɔ bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs ɔ.»<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Ɛwaazel ɛ ghaada Bhabhilɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee dhiiti fofop edus tɔ gwoo, esul pɛ si. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ghwyil, tin, duma yɛ nadi edjɛ mɛkas kɔ bɔs djas. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Nyɛ naazɛtsim nɛ mɛghaaz djas: «Yɛ eewyɛɛza, yɛ eewyɛɛza, boo Bhabhilɔn eewyɛɛza! Nenak, ye moo ɛ́ di embee esisim di ɔ. Ye moo ɛ́ mɔɔ kyee di esisim edhuud djas di ekɛsɔwa ɔ. Ye moo ɛ́ pɛ kyee enen nɛ bɛtit ɛ di nɛ edhuud di ààdjɛ gwyes ɛbee ɔ, di ɔ. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Membyak djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ naadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ gwam-gwam mɛzɔ mɛ. Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak naazɛso nyel tɔ mɛzɔ bɛ nɛ nɛ. Tin, bot ɛ di ebɔmsa esonok kɔ ɛko bɔs'ak ɔ naazɛvu kɔ ɛsu ɛ kwyɛl nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ nɛ esa e ghoŋ dhaa nyel ɛ.»<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Bhii tak, mɛ eebaagwak dhiiti gwood nadi edus pɛ tɔ gwoo, eke náá: «Wyiska tɔ lɛ, bot ɛ mbyak'am, bi ɛzɛkɛbeeaa dáa bot ɛ di sama nɛ nɛ tɔ mesyem mɛ ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààbee eboo egum ee nyɛ aaboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Etɛɛ náá, mesyem mɛ ɛpedyeebabu yak kɔ yii, batakɛkum pɛ tɔ gwoo. Deenek, Zɛɛb ààpadjisa embee mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Saka nyɛ dáa nyɛ nasa nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛboma nɛ yɛ tyee esok ebá nɛ dáa nyɛ nasa nɛ bot ɛ. Lwoodalka mɔɔ buku yɛ nɛ mɛnyok mɛ di enyan dhaa yii nyɛ nadjɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Nyɛ naadyeebakwyɛl duma nɛ mɛvu. Deenek, zukeka nyɛ nɛ boo mezuk nɛ mɛsyee. Tin, nyɛ nadi eke nyɛ ɛmet náá: “Mɛ ɛ́ wak ɛ́ dáa moma mɛkoozi, mɛ tok kus moma, mɛ aanàkwaabɔt ɛpum.” <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, egum djas nazenɛɛgaa étɛp'ɛ, yɛ waasoaa nyɛ é nyel é dwoo wat: Ɛbɛ́ di gó bot ɛ, ɛsyee nɛ pwom edee. Nyɛ aagóaa ɛ́ nɛ du; etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb mot mɛbwala ɛ pɛ́ɛ nyɛ.» <verse eid="REV 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak, bot ɛ nasɛɛga goŋ nɛ nɛ, nɛ ɛmyaala nɛ esa e ghoŋ bɛ ɔ, bɛ waadje mɛgwyɛ, bɛ waakɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ elo, é sok bɛ aabee eguluk ebyet pɛ ɛko ɛ ghaada bɛ dik ɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Bɛ waatyaa ɛtsetaɛpe étɛp ɛkaab boo mezuk ghaada aaboma nɛ yɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ waadi eke náá: «Haaa mezuk! Haaa mezuk! Ooo Bhabhilɔn, boo ghaada nɛ mɛbwala! Ɛwala wat eedjala, etɛɛ náá, wɔ neeboma nɛ yɔ feŋ!»<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Bot ɛ mɛbom nadi kɔ bɔs ɔ, naabaadje nɛ ɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ elo kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. Etɛɛ náá, ye tokapɛ nɛ mot aakabaabom esa e mɛbom mɔɔ: <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Ɛkok ɛ lɔɔd, ɛkok ɛ́ bɛ di esa epata nɛ yɛ ɛ, mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ, mɛyaka, nɛ ekaad di djóoaa lɛn ɛ, embɛɛ ekaad na tɔɔbelaa zɛnɔɔ ekaad di djóoaa swa ɛ, membi mɛ ele di ààbelaa mbɛs ɛ, membi mɛ esa djas nasael nɛ mɛdjɛ mɛ bɛzok ɛ nɛ ele e mɛtaŋ, esa ee nasael nɛ ghwooz na tɔɔbelaa di djóoaa blɔɔz ɛ, nɛ eghwooz nɛghu nɛ mbɛɛ mɛkok, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />nadjeebe, nɛ edhiiti esa ee di ekoobelaa edee nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛ bɛmɛnanas, nɛ mbi mɛnanas di edjóoaa miid ɛ, zɛnɔɔ epu ele na mbɛɛ mɛnuub di edikaa ɛ, bɛmɛnyok mɛ vin, mul, faalin, embɛɛ mɛbhek, engombɛ nɛ ebhata, eyaaga nɛ embem e yaaga, ekwom nɛ bot ɛ membok. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bot ɛ mɛbom ke nɛ ghaada ɛ́ náá: «Membi mɛ esa djas wɔ nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ, moo ɛ́ ààkabɛ pɛ daa lɔ, mɛvu djas nɛ esa bɔ yii ghoŋ djas tokapɛ, tin, bot aanàkwaakobaabee yɛ!» <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Bot ɛ mɛbom mɛ nazevu kɔ ɛsu ɛ esa e mɛbom yii bɛ nadi ebɔmsa pɛ tɔ ghaada tak ɛ, bɛ waatyaa ɛtsetaɛpe, ekaab feŋ di náá, yɛ ɛ́ yɔbɔ ɛ. Bɛ waadje nɛ ɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ elo. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Tin, bɛ waadi eke: «Haaa mezuk! Haaa mezuk nɛ boo ghaada! Nyɛ nabebɔt ɛ́ ekaad ee di edjóoaa lɛn ɛ, nɛ embɛɛ ekaad na tɔɔbelaa, nyel'ɛ nadi ɛ́ dipela nɛ mɛvunga mɛ lɔɔd, mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ zɛnɔɔ bɛmɛyaka. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Tin, tɔ mɔɔ ɛwala wat, mɛvu menek djas tokapɛ!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Ekomanda mɛsuwa, nɛ bot di etɔ́ mɛdjoŋ tɔ tak ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di esa mɛsa pɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot djas di ebela efute tɔ mɛsa tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ, bɔɔ djas nadi ɛ́ ɛtsetaɛpe. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Bɛ naazɛtsim é sok bɛ nabee eguluk e ghaada bɛ nadik ɛ: «Ye tok nɛ dhiiti ghaada dáa boo ghaada yak!» <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Tin, bɛ nadi eso piib kɔ elo, bɛ nadi edje, elɛka, etsim náá: «Haaa mezuk, haaa mezuk nɛ boo ghaada! Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ ekuma bɛ ɛ, bot djas nadi nɛ bɛmɛsuwa kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔ navu. Tin, ɛwala wat eedjala, étɛp mɛvu menek djas neediib!»<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Gwoo, myaala nɛ dáa ghaada di ewaazel ɛ! Bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb myaalaka. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb eepɛ́ɛ ghaada dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nasa ɛ!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti fofop na mɛbwala zɛnɔɔ boo ɛkok dáa ɛkok ɛ bɛ di esii bhum ble nɛ yɛ ɛ, mwas tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, eke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ boo ghaada Bhabhilɔn aamwasaa nɛ bhel djas, tin, bot aanàkabaabee yɛ! <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Bot aanàkabaagwak ebwoma e bot ɛ di ebwom ngɔmbi, elɔɔ toŋ, etii mɛdjeeb ɔ pɛ daa lɔ. Tin, bot ɛ́ aanàkabaabela membi mɛ bot djas di esa mɛsa mɛ mɛmbɔ ɛ, bot aanàkabaagwak ɛtap ɛ ɛkok ɛ di esiiaa ebhum e ble nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Mɛkas mɛ elama aanàkabaadi pɛ yɔ, bot aanàkabaagwak bhyeed mengbaaz nɛ mɛsyes di náá, bɛ aalóo nɛ ɛbá ɔ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa esa ɔ, bɔɔ ɛ nadi bɛghɛŋ kɔ bɔs, mɛsimba mɔ naakɔɔ bot ɛ bɔs djas.»<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ghaada Bhabhilɔn ɛ ghiya bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ yii bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nasee, ghiya bot djas nagóaa kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, naasee.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Mɛdjeeb mɛ mɛsoob pɛ tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood elii pɛ tɔ gwoo tyee bhyeed ɛdhuu ɛ bot, gwood tak nadi eke ɛ: «Aleluya! Duwalka Ghɛŋ, tsik, duma nɛ mɛbwala ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb'enaka. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Epɛ́ɛ bɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, tɔ epiki! Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eekwyesal moma na ghaa-mɛzɔ djɛ sɔs, moma nadi epul bɔs nɛ mɛzɔ mɛ ɔ. Nyɛ nawa nyɛ é feŋ ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ naagó bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ.» <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Bɛ naabaazɛke-kea sis náá: «Aleluya! Duwalka Ghɛŋ! Eguluk boo ghaada nadi edyak ɛ, ye ɛpebyet kɔm-kɔm!» <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Tin, bɛpaa mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ená (24) zɛnɔɔ edjema ená di nɛ tsik ɔ, naazɛghaaga bhwoob si, da kwyit mɛboŋ étɛp ɛduwal Zɛɛb, mot di kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ, bɛ eezɛke: «<char style="sc">Amɛn</char>! Aleluya! Duwalka Ghɛŋ!»<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛba ɛ Mɔn bhata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti gwood di edus pɛ bóó mɛkoozi di ɛ, zɛgék: «Duwalka Zɛɛb'enaka, biyɔ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ djas, biyɔ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ nɛ ɔ, bot ɛ mbyok nɛ bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyok ɔ». <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛgwak dhiiti gwood ebam tyee bhyeed bot ɛbuɛpe, bhyeed tak nadi eswak ɛ́ dáa eboo mɛsok, dáa eboo bɛghɛl ɛko. Ye nadi eke ɛ: «Aleluya! Duwalka Ghɛŋ! Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake yenaka eezekoobal ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Djhoomyaalaka, djhoodika nɛ mɛmyaala, djhooduwalka nyɛ! Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala ɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛba ɛ Mɔn bhata eezedjala. Deenek, myɛl moo ɛ́ nyɛ eezekomsa. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Bɛ eedjɛ nyɛ mbɛɛ kaad lɛn na kas-kas ààpuuza nɛ dhiiti sonok.» Kaad lɛn tak lyaal ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ epiki e bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Fofop eezɛke nɛ nam: «Kwyala: Mɛmyaala nɛ bot ɛ nadjóoaa étɛp ɛbela di tɔ ɛbyoŋ ɛba ɛ Mɔn bhata ɔ.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nam náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tin ɛ etɛtɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Mɛ naazɛghaaga sok bhwoob'ɛ, kwyit mɛboŋ si étɛp ɛduwal nyɛ, tin, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam: «Nàsa deenek! Mɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa dáa wɔy, nɛ bɔn-nyoog di ekɛ tɔ esosoob nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee Yezu natel ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛduwal.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Yɛ ɛ́ Sisim di edjɛ mbɛɛ esiiza etɛp ee bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di egoola kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ́.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot di ebe yaaga na puu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee gwoo mbek, wɔ gwaa, yaaga na puu zɛtuula. Tin, mot nadi kɔ yaaga tak ɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Sosoob nɛ Tsɛɛtsɛ, nyɛ nɛ pɛ́ɛ bot, nyɛ lumla dɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ epiki. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mis mɛ nadi ekas ɛ́ dáa ngel du, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ekɔtɔ e bɛghɛŋ kɔ lo. É nyel'ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ kwyala din dinaa bot ààgu ɛsuk ɛ tak, yɛ di ààdi nyɛy ɛmet ɔ. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naabɔt ndjookuwa nyɔlɔlɔ nɛ ghiya é tak. Din ɛ lɛ ɛ́: «Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mɛdhuu mɛ esodja djas di pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ, nadi edu nyɛ pɛ bhis, bɔɔ djas kɔ eyaaga e na puu, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eebɔt embɛɛ ekaad e na puu, ààbɛ nɛ edhuud. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Pɛl na zɔɔ-zɔɔ nadi ewyis tɔ nuub'ɛ, étɛp ɛgó bot ɛ mɛdhik. Nyɛ waadjɛɛd bot ɛ mɛdhik nɛ mɔɔ sek ghwooz. Nyɛ waatwaal ebhum e di edjóoaa lezɛ ɛ tɔ mɔɔ syaala mɛnyok mɛ vin mɛ ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Tin, kɔ ndjookuwa yɛ, nɛ kɔ do yɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ kwyala din: «Mɛkoozi mɛ bɛmɛkoozi, Ghɛŋ bɛghɛŋ.»<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee fofop ngɔt tetel pɛ tɔ gwyes. Nyɛ naazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe nɛ enen djas nadi edhaa ɛtsetaɛpe pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ náá: «Dhaka, sɛɛgaka étɛp boo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Dhadɛka epuud e bɛmɛkoozi, nɛ yii eboo ekukuma e esodja, nɛ yii bɛghɛŋ, nɛ epuud e eyaaga nɛ yii bot ɛ di edjɛɛd yɛ ɔ, epuud e bot djas, bot ɛ di ekwom ɔ nɛghu bot ɛ di ààdi ekwom ɔ, bot ɛ di nɛ mbyok nɛghu bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mbyok ɔ.»<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee tit, bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs'ak nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ esodja, sɛɛga étɛp ɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ mot nadi kɔ yaaga, nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ esodja bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Tin, tit naazɛmɛtaa, dɔɔ nɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ nadi esa mɛsimba é mis mɛ, étɛp ɛsa náá, bot ɛ nadi, bɛ eezewaaa geka tit ɔ, bot ɛ nadi eduwal ekpaka e naghisɛ yɛ ɔ, wo ze. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Bot ɛ nabwak ɔ naagóaa nɛ pɛl nadi ewyis tɔ nuub mot nadi kɔ yaaga yenɔk ɔ. É di'enek, enen djas naazɛdɛ epuud e bɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Satan eekɔɔlaa é membok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee fofop ngɔt edus tɔ gwoo, esul pɛ si, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ sap boo guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ nɛ boo kel ghwooz é mbɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Nyɛ eezɛmɛt dhalaghɔŋ, nyɔ na mwa, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ dim mot mɛkɔŋ nɛghu Satan. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛkɔl nyɛ, lóo nyɛ é membok pɛ nyɛ aakɛdi membu mil wat ɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Bhii fofop nalóo nyɛ tɔ boo guk na dim-dim di ààbɛ nɛ ɛsik ɛ, nyɛ eezɛkɔɔl yɛ nɛ sap, nyɛ eezɛtiŋal boo ɛtuŋa pɛ kɔ tak, kɛl luk, etɛɛ náá, dhalaghɔŋ needi ààbaasa náá, bot ɛ mɛdhik wo ze, kɛkum é ghɛŋ membu mil menek aadjaala ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ waawyiselaa étɛp ba mɔɔ ɛwala.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee mɛbhóó mɛ mɛkoozi, bot ɛ nadi mendiidel kɔ tak ɔ naabela ghwyil ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot. Mɛ naabaabee esisim e bot ɛ natsakaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ esosoob bɔɔ dum nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ee Yezu natel ɛ, nɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Bot binɔk nabɛ ɛ́ ààduwal tit nɛ naghisɛ yɛ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela geka tit kɔ ebhata-bhwoob, ààkobɛ-bɛak é mbɔ. Bɛ naagom, bɛ naadi sama nɛ Klisto membu mil wat. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nagwyɛ ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ ààgom ɛsok nɛ membu mil wat (1 000) yenek nɛ si. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛgom ɛ bot yii mɛkɛn. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Mɛmyaala nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nagomal é ɛgom ɛ mɛkɛn ɔ. Tin, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ Zɛɛb, ɛsyee ɛ bhɔɔba tokapɛ nɛ ghwyil kɔ lɔɔ. Deenek, bɛ kadi ɛ́ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ yɛ Klisto, bɛ waakɔk sama nɛ Klisto membu mil wat.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satan eepɛ́ɛa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />É ghɛŋ membu mil wat (1 000) yenek aadjala ɛ, Satan aawyiselaa é membok, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />nyɛ waatɔ́ kɛkɔɔ bot ɛ mɛdhik djas di kɔ etuma ená é bɔs ɔ, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́, Ghɔɔg nɛ Maghɔɔg<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ghɔɔg nɛ Maghɔɔg </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadi edjedjóo ekyee e mɛdhik mɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ bɔn ɛ Zɛɛb é mɛsik mɛ bhwak. Yɛ aabelaa ɛ́ tɔ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 38-39">Ɛze 38–39</ref></char>.</char></note>. Nyɛ aasɛɛg bɛ étɛp ɛduu tuub. Bɛ aadi ɛ́ ɛbuɛpe dáa bɛsyɛ é ngwoob boo dii mɛsɔn. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Bɛ eezɛwyɛɛza kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas. Bɛ eezɛdii ghaada Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ, di bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb di ɔ. Tin, du eezɛdus pɛ tɔ gwoo, wɔ gwaa, ye zɛsilal bɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Wɔ gwaa, dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot nadi ekɔɔ bɛ ɔ, zɛmwasaa tɔ tok du mɛsii na goo-goo, pɛ kyee tit nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ di ɔ. Deenek, bɛ aadi ɛ ezukaa mwos nɛ pum kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛpɛ́ɛa mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee boo bóó mɛkoozi na puu, nɛ mot ndiidel kɔ tak. Gwoo nɛ bɔs naazɛdiib sok bhwoob'ɛ, mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaabee yɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, bot di nɛ mbyok nɛ bot ɛ ààdi nɛ mbyok ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ metetel sok bóó mɛkoozi. Tin, bɛmɛkana naazɛdiiaa, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti mɛkana zɛbaadiiaa, yenek nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ tsik. Bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ napɛ́ɛaa ɛ́ dum nɛ sa bɛ nasa ɛ, dáa ye nazekwyalaa tɔ bɛmɛkana ɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Boo dii mɛsɔn naazɛbulal bot ɛ nagwyɛ tɔ tak ɔ, wɔ gwaa, ɛsyee nɛ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, zɛbulal yɛ pe. Deenek, mot nɛ mot naapɛ́ɛaa dum nɛ sa nyɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Tin, ɛsyee nɛ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, zokazɛmwasaa tɔ tok du. Tok du tak ɛ́ ɛsyee bhɔɔba. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Deenek, mot djas nadi ààbɛ nɛ din kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik ɔ, nyɛ naamwasaa tɔ tok du yenek.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Gwoo na bes nɛ bɔs na bes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Tin, mɛ eezɛbee gwoo na bes nɛ bɔs na bes. É di'enek, gwoo nadi é mɛkɛn nɛ bɔs nadi é mɛkɛn ɛ́ naadiib, boo dii mɛsɔn nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaadi tak. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee ghaada na dɛɛ, Yeluzalɛm na bes yii Zɛɛb nadhis ɛ, edus pɛ tɔ gwoo. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo babeega dáa moma zekomsa étɛp nyɛ neekɛboma nɛ ngom'ɛ ɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Mɛ naagwak dhiiti lyel-lyel gwood edus pɛ kyee bóó mɛkoozi: «Nenak, pɛt ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ é di wat nɛ bot! Nyɛ aakadidi ɛ́ sama wat nɛ nɔɔ, deenek, bɛ aakadi ɛ́ bot bɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet aadi ɛ́ sama nɛ nɔɔ, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Nyɛ waasuŋal miŋal mis mɔɔ djas. Ɛsyee aanàkabaadi tak, pil aanàkabaadi, ààbɛ nɛ elɛka, ààbɛ nɛ mezuk. Deenek, esa e na mwa djas aanàkabaadi tak.»<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />É di'enek, mot di ndiidel kɔ bóó mɛkoozi ɔ naake: «Nenak yak, mɛ ɛpekus esa e na bes.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke: «Kwyala dáak, etɛɛ náá, mɛkpa mak ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ, ye goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwaaa ɛbwaalel é tak.»<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Nyɛ eebaazɛke: «Yɛ eezesael! Mɛ ɛ́ <char style="sc">Alfa</char> nɛ <char style="sc">Omegha</char>, mɛkɛn nɛ mɛsik. Mot ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛdii ɔɔ, mɛ aadjɛ nyɛ mɛdii di edus tɔ sɔɔgɔ di edjɛ tsik ɛ, ààbwaal dhiiti sonok nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Nɛ mot aakwak ɔɔ, mɛ waadjɛ nyɛ esa e lyak binek. Mɛ aadi ɛ́ Zɛɛb'ɛ, nyɛy kadi ɛ́ mɔn'am. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Yɛ kabɛ bɛtsak-bel ɔɔ, bot ɛ di ààkɛ tɔ esosoob ɔ, bot ɛ di egó bot ɔ, bot ɛ di ekus ɛzɛm ɔ, bot ɛ mɛzɔ, bot ɛ mɛlyeeb, bot ɛ di eduwal bɛnaghisɛ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ etsal djas, bɛ waamwasaa tɔ boo tok du di nɛ mɛsii mɛ na goo-goo, yɛ ɛ́ di ɛsyee yii bhɔɔba.»<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeluzalɛm na bes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Fofof ngɔt tɔ efofop etɛn nɛ bɛbá, nadi nɛ ebuku etɛn nɛ ebá lwoodela nɛ egum e mɛsik ɔ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam: «Dha, mɛ aalyaal wɔ dhɛɛga, mwaa Mɔn bhata.»<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Sisim naazɛmɛt mɛ. Wɔ gwaa, fofop zɛtɔ́ nɛ nam kɔ dwol dhiiti boo ɛtsok ɛ na vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg. Nyɛ naatel mɛ ghaada na dɛɛ, yɛ ɛ́ Yeluzalɛm nadi edus pɛ tɔ gwoo, yii Zɛɛb nadhis ɛ, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ duma ɛ Zɛɛb. Ɛkas ɛ ghaada tak nadi enɔŋel ɛ́ nɛ ɛkok ɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa yaspɛ ɛ, djhaaz-djhaaz dáa ɛkok ɛ mɛtaadak. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ghaada tak nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ boo peeb, nɛ mɛniel kam nɛ ebá, ɛniel nɛ ɛniel nadi ɛ́ nɛ fofop ngɔt ebaal yɛ. Deenek, kɔ mɛniel mɛ tak, ye naakwyalaa min mɛ membyak kam nɛ ebá bot ɛ kyee dik Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Deenek, é epap e epeeb tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛniel mɛlɛl-mɛlɛl. Pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo elɛl, pɛ ɛsila dwoo elɛl, pɛ ɛko ɛ bɔs elɛl, pɛ kyɛ ɛbil ɛ dwoo elɛl. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Epap e epeeb ghaada tak, nasumaa ɛ́ pɛ kɔ mɛkok kam nɛ ebá, kɔ mɛkok mɛ tak, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ ekwyala e min mɛ bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ Mɔn bhata.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Fofop nadi elii nɛ nam ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɔɔ le ghwaazok nasael nɛ lɔɔd ɛ é mbɔ. Mɛsa mɛ mɔɔ le tak nabɛ ɛ́, étɛp ɛgek mɛdjaa mɛ ghaada, epap nɛ mɛniel mɛ tak. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Mɛdjaa mɛ epap e ghaada tak djas nadi ɛ́ djala. Tin, fofop nagek ghaada ɛ́ nɛ le ghwaazok'ɛ: Mɛdjaa mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, ekilomɛtɛlɛ bɛmil ɛbá nɛ bɛdhet-ɛbá (2 200), mɛbɔk mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ekilomɛtɛlɛ bɛmil ɛbá nɛ bɛdhet-ɛbá (2 200), mɛvyɛɛg mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ekilomɛtɛlɛ bɛmil ɛbá nɛ bɛdhet-ɛbá (2 200). <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Fofop naazɛgek mɛpip mɛ pap, ye nabɛ ɛ́ emɛtɛlɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat nɛ etɛn (65). Nyɛ nagek yɛ ɛ, dáa bot di ezyɛ nɛ ɛgek sok ɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Tin, peeb nasumaa ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa yaspɛ ɛ. Ghaada nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet nakasumaa ɛ́ nɛ tɛtɛ lɔɔd di ààpuuza nɛ dhiiti sonok ɛ, ɛdjhaazɛpe dáa mɛtaadak. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ghus-zumal epap e ghaada tak nasɔnaa ɛ́ nɛ membi mɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ djas. Yii ghus-zumal mɛkɛn nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa yaspɛ ɛ, yii bhɔɔba nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa safiid ɛ, yii elɛl nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa aghat ɛ, yii ená nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa emelood ɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />Yii etɛn nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa oniks ɛ, yii etɛn nɛ wat nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa saaldwan ɛ, yii etɛn nɛ ebá nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa kiizolit ɛ, yii etɛn nɛ elɛl nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa beelil ɛ, yii etɛn nɛ ená nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa topaaz ɛ, yii kam nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa kiizopaalas ɛ, yii kam nɛ wat nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa tulkwaaz ɛ, yii kam nɛ ebá nɛ mɛkok mɛ mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa amɛtis ɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Mɛniel kam nɛ ebá binek nabɛ ɛ́, bɛmɛyaka kam nɛ ebá. Ɛniel nɛ ɛniel nasael ɛ́ nɛ mɛyaka wat. Di bot djas di esɛɛga tɔ boo ghaada ɔ, ye nasael ɛ́ nɛ tɛtɛ lɔɔd di ààpuuza nɛ dhiiti sonok ɛ, ɛdjhaazɛpe dáa mɛtaadak.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbee ndjaa-Zɛɛb tɔ ghaada tak, etɛɛ náá, Di na Dɛɛ ghaada tak ɛ́ Ghɛŋ, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake dɔɔ nɛ Mɔn bhata. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Ghaada tak tok nɛ mɛkas mɛ gwyes nɛghu mɛkas mɛ ngɔn, etɛɛ náá, duma Zɛɛb nadi ekas, Mɔn bhata ɛ́ di lama yɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Bot ɛ mɛdhik ɛ́ waakɛ si mɛkas mɛ, bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs ɛ́ waazyɛ nɛ ekum bɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Tin, mɛniel mɛ ghaada aadi ɛ́ mbek tu dwoo. Deenek, yɛ aanàkabaadiyalaa etɛɛ náá, ɛgwyitok aanàbaagwyiidela. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Bɛ waazyɛ nɛ duma nɛ duu mɛvu mɛ bot ɛ mɛdhik mɛ sis. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Deenek, ye tok nɛ sa wat edhuud aani tɔ ghaada tak, ààkobɛ-bɛak bot ɛ di nɛ embee mɛsa ɔ nɛghu bot ɛ etsal. É di'enek, bot aani tɔ ghaada tak ɔ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ bot ɛ min mɔɔ di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik ɛ Mɔn bhata ɔ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Bhii tak, fofop naazɛlyaal mɛ dii tsik nadi edjhaazal dáa ɛkok ɛ mɛtaadak ɛ, ye nadi ewyis ɛ́ tɔ bóó mɛkoozi Zɛɛb nɛ Mɔn bhata. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Dii tak nadi edhaa kuku ghaada. Le tsik nabɛ ɛ́ pak mɛmbɔ mɛmbá mɛ dii. Le tak nadi edjɛ bhum esok kam nɛ ebá tɔ mbu wat, deenek, sok wat tɔ ngon wat. Tin, eka e tak ɛ́ di edjɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ mɛdhik. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Yɛ aanàkabaadi nɛ dhiiti sonok di náá, yɛ waabela mbee baka ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Bóó mɛkoozi Zɛɛb nɛ Mɔn bhata aadi ɛ́ tɔ ghaada tak. Tin, bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ waaduwal nyɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />É di'enek, bɛ waabee ɛbhwoob ɛ lɛ, din ɛ lɛ aadi ɛ́ kwyala kɔ ebhata-bhwoob bɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Pum aanàkabaadi tak, bot ɛ́ aanàkabaadi nɛ gwyes ngel lama, nɛghu mɛkas mɛ gwyes. Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb aasa náá, mɛkas mɛ di kɔ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, é di'enek, bɛ waakɔk kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu ɛpelɛɛ náá, nyɛ moo kɔ nɛ ɛzyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Bhii tak, fofop eezɛke nɛ nam: «Mɛkpa mak ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ di egoka nɛ ɛwaaa ɛbwaalel ɛ. Tin, Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb, mot di edjɛ etsoŋ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ naadhis fofop'ɛ étɛp ɛlyaal bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ, sa di náá yɛ aanàbɔya nɛ ɛsael ɛ.» <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yezu eezɛke: «Gwaka, mɛ moo aazyɛ! Mɛmyaala nɛ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ mɛkpa mɛ natelaa di tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ!»<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Mam Zaŋ, mɛ naagwak, mɛ naabee etɛp bak. Bhii mɛ nagwak nɛ ɛbee ɛ, mɛ naazɛghaaga si sok bhwoob fofop, mot natel mɛ esonok binek, étɛp mɛ needuwal nyɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: «Nàsa deenek! Mɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa dáa wɔy, dáa bɔn-nyoog, bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, dáa bot djas di elooba nɛ mɛkpa di tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛduwal!»<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaake: «Sa wɔ ààsyel mɛkpa natelaa wɔ, di tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, ɛwala nabɛ náá, esa bak aasael ɛ, ye moo kunaa. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Mot di esa ɛbiyo ɔ, gheesa ɛbiyo. Mot di nɛ edhuud ɔ, gheedi tɔ yɛ edhuud. Tin, mot di esa enɛm esa ɔ, gheesa enɛm esa, mot di tɔ edɛɛ ɔ, gheedi tɔ edɛɛ bɛ.»<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yezu eezɛke: «Gwaka: Mɛ moo aazyɛ! Mɛ aazyɛ nɛ efute étɛp ɛdjɛ mot nɛ mot, dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Mɛ ɛ́ <char style="sc">Alfa</char> nɛ <char style="sc">Omegha</char>, mot mɛkɛn nɛ mot mɛsik, mɛkɛn nɛ mɛsik.»<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Mɛmyaala nɛ bot ɛ di egwyii ekaad bɔɔ ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ waabela ze ɛdɛ bhum le tsik, da bɛ ɛ́ ɛni tɔ mɛniel mɛ ghaada. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Tin, pɛ kel, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ mɛfulu dáa bɛbhyɛ ɔ, bot ɛ mɛlyeeb, bot ɛ mɛzɔ, bot ɛ di egó bot ɔ, bot ɛ di eduwal bɛnaghisɛ ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot djas di ekwyɛl mɛkɔŋ nɛ ɛlɛɛ elɛŋ etsal ɔ!<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />«Mam Yezu, mɛ naadhis fofop'am étɛp ɛkɛlyaal bin etɛp bak djas dum nɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala. Mɛ ɛ́ mɔn dha ɛ Dhavid, mɛ ɛ́ kwyikwyen di ekas tɔ mɛlem ɔ.»<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Tin, Sisim nɛ moma ɛbá, mwaa Mɔn bhata ɛpelɛɛ: «Dha!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Mot di egwak yɛ ɔ, baake ɛ: «Dha!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Mot di nɛ gwyes mɛdii ɔ zyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Mot di ekwyɛl mɛdii mɛ di edjɛ tsik ɔ, nyɛ aabela yɛ yii toto!<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlii ɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Mam Zaŋ, mɛ lɛɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ mot nɛ mot di egwak mɛkpa natelaa tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ náá: Mot ɛ bil dhiiti sonok ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waakɛl egum zekwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />É di'enek, mot ɛ dis dhiiti sonok tɔ mɛkpa natelaa di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mak ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadis yɛ ɛkɛɛ ɛ bhum le di edjɛ tsik ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ tɔ ghaada na dɛɛ di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mak ɛ.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Mot di elyaal etsɛɛtsɛ e etɛp bak ɔ, lɛɛ ɛ́: «Iyooo, mɛ moo aazyɛ!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">
    <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>! Dha, Ghɛŋ Yezu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu di nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>